hadiths[273]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3626","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk aadmy jw shrab py rha tha nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas laya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay whan mwjwd lwgwn say kha kh asay marw، tw hm myn say ksy nay asay apnay hathwn say، ksy nay apnay jwtwn say awr ksy nay apnay kprwn say mara۔ phr jb wh shkhs chla gya awr whan mwjwd lwgwn myn say ayk nay kha، ''khda tmhyn shrmndh kray''، nbyﷺ nay frmaya: ''aysy bat nh krw۔ shytan kw as pr qabw panay myn mdd nh krw۔\ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3627","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh aslmy (yany mayz dykhyn s 759) nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr char mrtbh gwahy dy kh myn nay ayk awrt say najayz jmaa kya hay، jb kh aap sly allh alyh wslm hr wqt as say mnh mwr rhay thay۔ phr jb as nay panchwyn bar aqrar kya tw as nay plt kr pwchha kh kya as nay as say hmbstry ky hay، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh as nay kya tha tw as nay pwchha kh kya as nay aysa kya tha kh as ka rkn as myn ghs gya۔ as nay jwab dya kh as kay pas hay، awr as nay pwchha kh kya as nay yh kam kwlyrym ky chhry ky trh kya hay jb as kay kys myn bnd hw awr knwyn myn rsy hw۔ as kay jwab myn kh aysa hy hay tw as nay pwchha kh kya wh janta hay kh zna kya hay tw as nay jwab dya kh han myn nay as kay sath wh najayz kya hay jw mrd apny bywy kay sath jayz tryqay say krskta hay۔ as nay phr pwchha kh as kay khnay say wh kya chahta hay tw as nay jwab dya kh myn chahta hwn kh myn asay pak krdwn tw as nay hkm dya awr asay sngsar krdya gya۔ phr khda kay nby nay apnay ayk sathy kw dwsray say yh khtay hwyay sna kh as shkhs kw dykhw js kay ayb kw khda nay chhpa rkha tha lykn wh as bat kw akyla nhyn chhwr skta tha kh asay ktay ky trh sngsar kr dya gya tha۔ as nay an say kchh nh kha lykn kchh dyr chltay rhay yhan tk kh wh ayk gdhay ky lash kay pas phnchay js ky tangyn hwa myn thyn۔ as nay phr pwchha kh flan flan awr flan flan khan hyn awr jb anhwn nay jwab dya kh wh whan hyn tw as nay kha nychay jao awr as gdhay ky lash myn say kchh kha lw۔ anhwn nay jwab dya kh allh kay nby as myn say kwn kha skta hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm nay apnay bhayy ky jw bay azty ky hay wh as myn say kchh khanay say bhy zyadh sngyn hay، as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، wh ab jnt ky ndywn myn say hay jw an myn dwb rhy hyn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3628","khzymh by۔ sabt rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw kwyy gnah kray awr as gnah ky mqrrh sza asay day tw yh as kay lyay kfarh hay۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"3629","aly rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw kwyy zlm kray awr as ky sza as dnya myn payay tw allh taalyٰ as qdr ansaf krnay wala hay kh wh apnay bnday kw aakhrt myn azab dhra day، awr agr kwyy zyadty kray awr khda asay chhpayay awr asay maaf kr day tw wh as chyz kw waps krnay kay lyay bht skhy hay jw as nay maaf kr dy hay۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3630","abw brdh by۔ nyar say rwayt hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh ds say zyadh kwray nhyn maray jayyn gay swayay as kay kh khda ky trf say mqrr krdh szaon myn say ksy ayk kay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3631","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy maray tw chhray pr marnay say gryz kray۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3632","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kwyy shkhs ksy dwsray yhwdy kw khay tw asay bys kwray marw، jb wh ksy kw mkhns khay tw asay bys kwray marw، awr jw hram khwr awrt say jmaa kray asay qtl kr dw“۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔ *mkhnath jnsy twr pr ghyr mamwly mrd thay jw awrtwn ky nql krtay thay۔ an myn say kchh dstkht thay۔"
"3633","sydna amr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm ksy aadmy kw rah khda myn ghnymt myn khyant krtay hwyay pao tw as ka saman jla dw awr asay marw۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3634","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”shrab an dw drkhtwn say nklty hay، khjwr awr angwr ky byl۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3635","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh amr rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay mnbr pr khtab krtay hwyay frmaya: shrab ky hrmt nazl hwyy hay (alqraan، 5:90) awr yh panch chyzwn say aaty hay: angwr، khjwr، gndm، jw awr shhd، shrab (khmr) wh chyz hay jw dmagh kw mtasr krty hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3636","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn: shrab jb hram ky gyy thy (yany qraan nay)، lykn hmyn angwrwn say thwry sy shrab mlty hay، hmary zyadh tr shrab kchy khjwr awr khshk khjwr ky hwty hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3637","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say shhd kay nbyz kay baray myn pwchha gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr wh shrab jw nshh aawr hw hram hay۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) * nbyz ayk mshrwb hay jw khjwr، kshmsh، shhd، gndm، jw wghyrh say tyar kya jata hay، ajzaa kw brtn myn pany myn dala jata hay، awr agr yh mshrwb abal aanay say phlay astamal kya jayay tw yh hlal hay۔"
"3638","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr nshh aawr chyz khmr hay awr hr nshh aawr chyz hram hay، jw shkhs dnya myn shrab pyta hay awr as ky lt myn mbtla hw kr mr jata hay awr twbh nhyn krta tw wh aakhrt myn shrab nhyn pyta“۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3639","jabr rzy allh anh nay ayk aadmy ka zkr kya jw ymn say aaya tha awr as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say jwar say bny hwyy shrab kay baray myn pwchha jsay wh apnay mlk myn pytay thay۔ nby krym sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha kh kya yh nshh aawr chyz hay awr jb aap nay jwab dya kh yh hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr nshh aawr chyz hram hay، allh taalyٰ nay nshh pynay walwn say ahd lya hay kh anhyn kchh tynt alkhbal playa jayay ga۔ as say pwchha gya kh wh kya hay tw as nay jwab dya kh yh jhnmywn ka psynh hay ya ahl jhnm ka psynh hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3640","abw qtadh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay khshk khjwr awr kchy khjwr kw mlanay، kshmsh awr khshk khjwr kw mlanay say mna frmaya awr khjwryn rng awr tazh khjwrwn kw mlanay say mna frmaya awr an say kha kh hr ayk say alg alg nbyz bnayyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3641","hzrt ans rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm say shrab kay baray myn pwchha gya jw srkh myn bdl jaty hay tw aap nay as say mna frmaya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ * as myn pyaz ya nmk dal kr ya dhwp myn rkh kr aysa kya jata hay۔"
"3642","wayl alhdrmy nay kha kh tarq bn swyd nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say shrab kay baray myn pwchha tw aap nay mna kr dya۔ jb as nay asay btaya kh myn nay asay srf dwa kay twr pr bnaya hay tw as nay jwab dya kh yh dwa nhyn hay blkh bymary hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3643","abdallh by۔ amr rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shrab pyay ga allh taalyٰ as ky chalys dn tk nmaz qbwl nhyn kray ga، lykn agr wh twbh kray tw allh taalyٰ asay maaf kr day ga، agr wh gnah dhrayay tw allh taalyٰ as ky chalys dn tk daa qbwl nhyn kray ga، lykn agr wh twbh kray tw allh taalyٰ asay maaf kr day ga، agr as nay dwbarh gnah kya tw allh taalyٰ as ky chalys dn tk daa qbwl nhyn kray ga، lykn agr as nay char mrtbh daa nh ky tw allh taalyٰ as ky mghfrt frmayay ga۔ as say chalys dn tk، awr agr wh twbh krta hay tw khda asay maaf nhyn kray ga، blkh asay jhnm walwn ky trf say bhty hwyy ndy ka pany playay ga۔\ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3644","nsayy، abn majh awr darmy nay asay abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt kya hay۔ amrw"
"3645","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr ksy chyz ky zyadh mqdar nshh aawr hw tw as ky thwry mqdar hram hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3646","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr ksy chyz ka ayk fraq nshh pyda kray tw as ky mthy bhr hram hay۔ fraq jtna pyna (mlahzh hw sfhh 577) tqrybaً nammkn hw ga، as lyay rwayt ka nkth yh hay kh hr aysy chyz say mna kya jayay jw ksy bhy qabl fhm halt myn nshh ka baas hw۔"
"3647","alnaman b۔ bshyr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”gndm say shrab bnty hay، jw say shrab bnty hay، khshk khjwr say shrab bnty hay، kshmsh say shrab bnty hay awr shhd say shrab bnty hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3648","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh an kay pas ayk ytym ky shrab thy، jb almayd (alqraan، 5) atry tw as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say as kay baray myn pwchha، aap nay frmaya kh yh ytym ky hay، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: asay dal dw۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3649","ans nay abw tlhh say nql kya hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kha kh myn nay an ytymwn kay lyay shrab khrydy hay jw an kay zmh thay، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \shrab dalw awr shrab kay brtnwn kw twr dw۔\"" trmzy nay asay nql kya hay lykn asay zayf qrar dya hay۔ abwdaod ky rwayt myn hay kh anhwn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say an ytymwn kay baray myn pwchha jnhyn wrast myn shrab mly thy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: asay dal dw۔ as nay pwchha kh kya wh as ka srkh nhyn bna skta awr as nay asay btaya kh asay nhyn bnana chahyay۔ abwdaod"""""
"3650","am slmh rzy allh anha nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hr nshh aawr chyz awr hr as chyz say mna frmaya jw ssty pyda krty hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3651","dylam alhmyry nay byan kya kh as nay kha، \khda kay rswl، hm ayk srd zmyn myn rhtay hyn jhan hm bhary kam krtay hyn awr hm gndm say shrab bnatay hyn takh apnay kam kay lyay taqt hasl kryn awr apnay mlk ky srdy ka mqablh kryn۔\"" as nay pwchha kh kya yh nshh aawr hay، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh yh hay، tw as nay kha kh anhyn as say bchna chahyay۔ jb as nay jwab dya kh lwg asay nhyn chhwryn gay tw aap nay frmaya: agr wh asay nh chhwryn tw an say lrw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3652","abdallh by۔ amrw byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay shrab، msyr، kba awr ghbyrh say mna frmaya awr frmaya: hr nshh aawr chyz hram hay۔ abd daod nay asay mntql kya۔ *yh ayk jama rwayt hay js ka talq srf nshh aawr chyzwn kay sath nhyn hay، halankh nby kay alfaz say yh malwm hwta hay۔ mysr mwqa ka khyl tha awr kwba ayk qsm ka dhwl tha jw srwn pr chwra awr drmyan myn tng tha jsay napsndydgy say dykha jata tha۔ nshh aawr ashyaa say mrad shrab (khmr) awr ghbyrh hyn jw hbshywn nay jwar say bnayy thy۔"
"3653","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: ”bay prwa byta، jwary، jw jhwt bwla as kw phynknay wala، awr shrab ka aady jnt myn dakhl nhyn hw ga۔ darymy nay asay mntql kya۔ as kay ayk wrzhn myn jwary ky bjayay kmynay hay۔"
"3654","abw amamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh nay mjhay kaynat kay lyay rhmt awr kaynat kay lyay hdayt bna kr bhyja hay، awr myray rb nay jw azym w bzrg hay as nay mjhay tarwn، hwa kay aalat، btwn، slybwn awr qbl az aslam kay rswm w rwaj kw khtm krnay ka hkm dya hay، awr myra rb jw azym awr bzrgy wala hay، myray bnday kw kwyy taqt nhyn playay gy۔ myn nay asay atny hy mqdar myn pyp dyay bghyr mnh bhry shrab، lykn wh myray khwf say asay trk nhyn kray ga jb tk kh myn asay mqds hwzwn say nh plaon۔\ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3655","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tyn aysay hyn jn pr allh taalyٰ nay jnt hram kr dy hay: ayk shrab ka aady، ayk bay prwa byta awr wh jw apny awrtwn ky zna pr razy hw“۔ asay ahmd awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3656","abw mwsyٰ ashary rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tyn aysay hyn jw jnt myn dakhl nhyn hwn gay: ayk shrab ka aady، dwsra rshth twr dynay wala awr jadw pr yqyn rkhnay wala۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3657","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr shrab ka aady shkhs mr jayay tw wh allh taalyٰ say asy halt myn mlay ga js halt myn mshrk hay۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3658","abn majh nay abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt ky hay۔"
"3659","byhqy nay shab alayman myn asay mhmd bn abdalazyz say rwayt kya hay۔ abydallh js nay apnay wald ky snd ka hwalh dya۔ anhwn nay kha kh bkhary nay apny tarykh myn mhmd bn abdalazyz say as ka zkr kya hay۔ abdallh js nay apnay wald kay akhtyar ka hwalh dya۔"
"3660","abw mwsyٰ khtay thay: myray lyay yh sb brabr hay kh myn shrab pywn ya khda kay bjayay as stwn ky abadt krwn۔* asay nsayy nay nql kya hay۔ *wh khta hay kh ayk gnah dwsray ky trh sngyn hay۔"
"3661","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js nay myry ataat ky as nay allh ky ataat ky awr js nay myry nafrmany ky as nay allh ky nafrmany ky، js nay srdar ky ataat ky as nay myry ataat ky awr js nay srdar ky nafrmany ky as nay myry nafrmany ky، amam srf ayk dhal hay js kay pychhay lrayy hwty hay awr js say hfazt ky zrwrt hwty hay awr agr wh hkm dyta hay tw as ky mdd krta hay۔ as kay lyay، lykn agr wh kwyy awr nzryh rkhta hay tw wh as hsab say qswrwar thhray ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3662","am alhsyn rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy ghlam js ka mskh kya gya hw، tmhara hakm bna dya jayay awr wh tmhyn ktab alhy kay mtabq lay jayay tw as ky bat snw awr ataat krw“۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3663","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”snw awr ataat krw، khwah ayk hbshy ghlam js ka sr kshmsh kay brabr hw* tm pr hakm bna dya jayay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ * as say mrad sr ka chhwta hwna، ya balwn kay krkra awr ghngryalay، ya chhwtay hwnay kw kha jata hay۔"
"3664","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”snna awr ataat krna mslman pr frz hay kh wh kya psnd kray awr kya napsnd، jb tk kh asay allh ky nafrmany ka hkm nh dya jayay، as swrt myn asay nh snna chahyay awr nh hy ataat krna chahyay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3665","aly rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh ky nafrmany ky swrt myn ataat nhyn ky jayay gy، ataat srf as chyz ky hay jw marwf hw۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3666","abadh by۔ smyt nay kha: hm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say byat ky kh mshkl awr aasany kay wqt snnay awr mannay pr razy hwn، jw kchh hm psnd krtay hyn awr kya napsnd krtay hyn، dwsrwn kay mfadat kw aagay brhatay hyn، aqtdar walwn kay sath hkwmt kay baray myn jhgra nhyn krtay، awr jhan bhy thay wh shyh khtay thay، khda kay lyay khwf nhyn rkhtay thay kh jw hm pr alzam lgayay wh kya khay۔ ayk wrzhn myn hay، \hkwmt kay baray myn an lwgwn kay sath jhgra nh kryn jb tk kh aap kw wazh kfr nzr nh aayay js kay baray myn aap kay pas khda ky trf say sbwt mwjwd hay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3667","abn amr rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh jb anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say snnay awr ataat krnay pr byat ky tw aap sly allh alyh wslm an say khh rhay thay: ”tm js chyz ky taqt rkhtay hw“۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3668","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy apnay hakm myn wh chyz dykhay jsay wh napsnd krta hay tw asay sbr say kam lyna chahyay، kywnkh kwyy bhy amt say ayk dwr ky dwry nhyn rkhta awr zmanh jahlyt ky trh mray bghyr nhyn mrta“۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3669","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”js nay ataat kw chhwr dya awr jmaat say alyhdgy akhtyar ky awr phr mr gya wh zmanh jahlyt ky trh mray ga، jw jahlyt kay jhnday tlay lray ga، jmaat ky hmayt myn ghsh kray ga، ya jmaaty jzbay ky trf blayay ga، ya jmaat kay jzbay ky mdd kray ga، awr phr apnay zmanay kay lwgwn kay sath mara jayay ga۔ nyk awr mlamt krnay waly tlwar، mwmnyn say dwr nh rhna ya jw ahd kya gya hay as ky pasdary ka mjh say kwyy talq nhyn awr nh myra as say kwyy talq hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ *'amyh، ya 'amyh، ya tw fkhr ya ghlty ka mtlb hay. myn nay as ka trjmh ’’jhalt‘‘ kay twr pr kya hay، kywnkh as ky wzaht yhan an lwgwn kay lyay ky gyy hay jw as bat pr ghwr kyay bghyr lrtay hyn kh wh hq pr hyn ya nhyn۔"
"3670","awf by۔ malk ashjay rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tmharay bhtryn amam wh hyn jn kw tm psnd krtay hw awr jw tmhyn psnd krtay hw، jn pr tm drwd prhtay hw awr jw tm pr drwd bhyjtay hw، awr tmharay bdtryn amam wh hyn jn say tm nfrt krtay hw awr wh tm say bghz rkhtay hw، jn pr tm lant krtay hw awr wh tm pr lant krtay hw۔ anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh kya as swrt myn anhyn mazwl nhyn krna chahyay، aap nay frmaya: nhyn jb tk wh tmharay drmyan nmaz prhtay rhyn، nhyn، jb tk kh wh tmharay drmyan nmaz prhtay rhyn، agr kwyy aysa gwrnr hw jsay wh khda ky nafrmany krtay hwyay dykhay tw asay khda ky nafrmany kw napsnd krna chahyay، lykn as say kbhy dstbrdar nhyn hwna chahyay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3671","am slmh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmharay pas aysay kmandr hwn gay jn myn say kchh kw tm psnd krw gay awr kchh kw napsnd krw gay، jw napsndydgy ka azhar krta hay wh bay qswr hay awr jw napsndydh mhsws krta hay wh mhfwz hay، lykn jw khwsh hw kr an ky pyrwy krta hay...“ an kay snnay walwn nay drmyan myn kha: kya hm an say jng nh kryn؟ lykn as nay jwab dya، \nhyn، jb tk wh nmaz prhtay hyn، nhyn، jb tk wh nmaz prhtay hyn۔\"" as say mrad wh hay jw apnay dl myn narazgy mhsws kray awr dl myn narazgy ka azhar kray۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3672","abdallh by۔ msawd rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya: ”myry wfat kay bad tm [hkmranwn] kw apnay lyay bhtryn chyzyn mkhts krtay hwyay dykhw gay awr dwsray amwr bhy jnhyn tm napsnd krw gay۔ aap say pwchha gya kh aap nay an kw kya hkm dya hay tw jwab dya: \jw an ka hq hay wh anhyn dw awr jw kchh tm pr hay khda say mangw۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)۔"""""
"3673","wayl b۔ hjr nay btaya kh slamh bn yzyd aljwfy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say swal kya kh ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmyn btayyn kh aap hmyn kya krnay ka hkm dytay hyn agr hm pr aysay hkmran aajayyn jw hm say an ka hq mangyn awr jw hm pr wajb hay ankar kr dyn۔ as nay jwab dya، \snw awr ataat krw، kywnkh wh srf as kay zmh dar hyn jw an pr aayd kya gya hay (cf. alqraan، 24:54) awr aap as kay zmh dar hyn jw aap pr aayd kyay gyay hyn۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3674","abdallh by۔ amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”js nay ataat kw trk kr dya wh qyamt kay dn allh say mlaqat kray ga، bghyr ksy azr kay، awr jw shkhs byat kyay bghyr mr gya wh kafr ky trh mray ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3675","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: bny asrayyl pr anbyaa alyhm alslam ky hkwmt thy، jtny bar an ky jgh ayk dwsray ky mwt waqa hwyy، myray bad kwyy nby nhyn aayay ga، lykn bht say khlyfh hwn gay۔ an say pwchha gya kh aap kw kya hkm dyna hay tw jwab dya kh hr ayk ky byat pwry krw awr an ka hq ada krw kywnkh khda an say as chyz kay baray myn swal kray ga js ky hfazt krnay kw kha hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3676","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \jb dw khlfaa ky byat ky jayay tw an myn say dwsray kw qtl kr dyn۔* mslm nay asay nql kya hay۔ * baz nay yhan 'qtl' ka mtlb jng say tabyr kya hay۔ rwayt ayk hy wqt myn dw khlfaa kay aqtdar pr fayz hwnay kay amkan kay khlaf hay، agrchh alaqay kafy alg alg hwn۔"""""
"3677","arfjh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh mkhtlf fsadat pyda hwn gay، lhza as kw tlwar say marw jw as qwm kay mthd hw kr an myn tfrqh dalnay ky kwshsh kray، khwah wh kwyy bhy hw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3678","as nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh agr kwyy tmharay pas as wqt aayay jb tm ayk aadmy kay matht hw awr tm myn tfrqh dalna chahtay hw ya tmhary jmaat myn frqh bndy krna chahtay hw tw asay qtl kr dw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3679","abdallh by۔ amrw rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy amam ky byat kray، as ky twsyq myn hath day awr dl myn aqrar kray tw asay chahyay kh as ky ataat kray، phr agr kwyy dwsra aayay awr as say jhgra kray tw as ka sr kat dw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3680","abdalrhmn by۔ smrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya: ”kmandr ka ahdh mt mangw، kywnkh agr tmhyn mangnay kay bad dya gya tw tm khwd hy asay chhwr dw gay، lykn agr tmhyn bghyr mangay day dya jayay ga tw as kw pwra krnay myn tmhary mdd ky jayay gy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3681","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm amyr kay ahday kay lyay bay chyn hw gay، lykn yh qyamt kay dn ndamt ka baas bnay ga، yh achha dwdh pynay wala hay lykn dwdh chhranay wala hay۔ *shrwa myn tw lzt ka baas bnta hay lykn bad myn aysy lztyn mnqta hwjaty hyn۔ khyal yh hay kh kwyy khwshy say aalyٰ ahdh snbhalta hay، lykn bad myn asay ghm ka baas malwm hwta hay۔"
"3682","abwzr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say aap kw gwrnr bnanay ky drkhwast ky، lykn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apna hath aap kay kndhay pr mara awr frmaya: ”abw zr tm kmzwr hw، awr yh ayk amant hay jw qyamt kay dn shrmndgy awr ndamt ka baas hw gy، swayay as kay js nay asay athana chahyay awr as myn apna frz pwra kya۔ ayk rwayt myn aap nay as say frmaya kh abwzr myn tm kw kmzwr dykhta hwn awr myn tmharay lyay why chahta hwn jw myn apnay lyay chahta hwn، dw aadmywn pr hkwmt nh krw awr ksy ytym kay mal ka nghban nh bnw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3683","abw mwsyٰ nay kha: myray dw chcha zad bhayy jw myray wald ky trf thay awr myn nby krym sly allh alyh wslm say mlnay kay lyay andr gya awr an myn say ayk nay kha: \khda kay rswl، hmyn as kay kchh hsay ka hkm day dyn jw allh nay aap kay sprd kya hay۔\"" dwsray nay bhy yhy kha۔ as nay jwab dya kh myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh myn as kam ky zmh dary ksy aysay shkhs kw nhyn dwn ga jw as ka tlb gar hw ya jw as ka shwqyn hw۔ ayk wrzhn myn as nay kha، \""hm apnay kam myn ksy kw kam nhyn kryn gay jw yh chahta hay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3684","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm bhtryn lwgwn myn say an lwgwn kw pao gay jw as hkm kw skht napsnd krtay hyn yhan tk kh wh as myn pr jatay hyn۔“* (bkhary w mslm)* as ka mtlb yh hay kh ya tw wh akhtyar kw napsnd krna chhwr dytay hyn awr bhtryn lwgwn myn shaml hwna chhwr dytay hyn، ya phr anhyn malwm hwta hay kh allh an ky mdd krta hay۔ phly wzaht kw trjyh dy jaty hay، lykn tbsrh yh kya jata hay kh jw bhy wzaht drst hw، aakhr myn yh lwg akhtyar rkhnay pr aatraz nhyn krtay۔"
"3685","abdallh by۔ hzrt amr rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn say hr ayk chrwaha hay awr tm myn say hr ayk apnay rywr ka zmh dar hay، amam jw lwgwn pr hay wh chrwaha hay awr apnay rywr ka zmh dar hay، mrd apnay ghr walwn ka chrwaha hay awr wh apnay rywr ka zmh dar hay، awrt chrwaha hay awr shwhr apnay ghr ka zmh dar hay awr mrd apnay ghr ka zmh dar hay۔ apnay malk kay mal ka chrwaha hay awr wh as ka zmh dar hay tw tm myn say hr ayk chrwaha hay awr tm myn say hr ayk apnay rywr ka zmh dar hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3686","mql b۔ ysar nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh ”mslmanwn ka kwyy gwrnr jw an kay sath bay aymany krtay hwyay mr jayay tw allh asay jnt say kharj kr day ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3687","anhwn nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh \js shkhs kw allh taalyٰ nay hkm dya kh wh raaya ky zmh dary snbhalay awr an ky achhy nsyht kay sath hfazt nh kray wh jnt ky khwshbw bhy nhyn payay ga۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3688","'ayd b. amrw rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: ”bdtryn chrwahay wh hyn jw bay rhm hyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3689","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aay allh as kw tklyf day jw myry amt pr zmh dar hw awr an kw tklyf day، awr as kay sath nrmy kr jw myry amt pr zmh dar hw awr an kay sath nrm hw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3690","abdallh by۔ amrw by۔ jysa kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt hay kh: \ansaf krnay walay allh kay sath nwr kay mnbrwn pr rhmn kay dahnay hath pr hwn gay، awr as kay dwnwn hath dayyn hyn، yh wh lwg hyn jw apnay dayrh akhtyar myn، apny qwm awr an ky zmh darywn myn ansaf krtay hyn۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ *as jmlay ky wzaht ya tw lghwy many myn ky gyy hay، ya an kay blnd mqam ky nshandhy kay twr pr ky gyy hay۔"""""
"3691","abwsayd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kwyy nby allh ky trf say nhyn bhyja jata awr kwyy khlyfh dwsray kay janshyn nhyn hwta hay js kay dw qryby sathy nh hwn، ayk wh jw asay marwf kam krnay ka hkm dyta hw awr dwsra brayy ka hkm dyta hw awr as ky trghyb dyta hw، mhfwz wh hay js ky hfazt allh kray۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3692","ans nay kha kh qys bn sad rzy allh anh kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay hwalay say wh mqam hasl tha jysa kh ayk zla kay pryfykt kw gwrnr kay hwalay say۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3693","hzrt abwbkrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay sna kh ahl fars nay ksryٰ ky byty kw apny mlkh bna lya hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw lwg awrt kw hakm bnatay hyn wh kbhy flah nhyn patay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3694","hars ashary rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn tmhyn panch chyzwn ka hkm dyta hwn: amt kw qaym rkhna، snna، ataat krna، hjrt krna awr allh ky rah myn jhad krna، js nay jmaat say ayk mdt tk alyhdgy akhtyar ky as nay aslam ky grdn atar dy، jb tk kh wh waps nh aayay، awr wh js nay ahl aslam kw dawt dy، wh jmaat ky trf say ayman lay aayay۔ chahay wh rwzay rkhay، nmaz prhay awr mslman hwnay ka dawyٰ kray۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3695","zyad by۔ ksyb aladwy nay kha: myn abwbkrh kay sath abn aamr kay mnbr kay nychay tha jb wh waz frma rhay thay awr ptlay kpray phnay hwyay thay۔ abw blal nay kha kh hmaray gwrnr kw dykhw jw bay hyayy ka lbas phnay hwyay hay، tw abwbkrh nay as say kha kh chp hw jao، kywnkh as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna tha kh jw shkhs zmyn pr allh kay hakm kw hqyr smjhay ga، allh asay hqyr smjhay ga۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3696","alnwas b۔ smaan nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mkhlwq ky ataat as wqt nhyn ky jayay gy jb as myn ”khalq“ ky nafrmany hw۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"3697","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ds aadmywn pr hakm hw ga asay qyamt kay dn byrywn myn dala jayay ga yhan tk kh ansaf as ky znjyryn khwl day ya zlm asay tbah kr day“* darmy nay asay nql kya hay۔ * hwalh as ansaf ya zlm ka hay jw as nay apnay dftr ky antzamyh myn zahr kya hay۔"
"3698","as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan krtay hwyay frmaya: \wayay gwrnrwn pr، afsws hay srdarwn pr، afsws hay ngranwn pr، qyamt kay dn lwg tmna kryn gay kh kash an ky pyshanyan plyydz say bndhy hwn، kh wh aasman w zmyn kay drmyan jhwl rhay hwn، awr yh kh anhwn nay kbhy kwyy qaadh astamal nhyn kya۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya، as ka wrzhn yh khtay hwyay، \""kh an kay bhtay hwyay bal Pleiades kay sath bndhay hwyay thay، kh wh aasman awr zmyn kay drmyan ltk rhay thay، awr yh kh anhyn kbhy ksy chyz ka gwrnr nhyn bnaya gya tha۔\"" * an kay aasman awr zmyn kay drmyan jhwlnay ka khyal yh hay kh wh kash wh apny zndgy myn dnya say bht dwr hw gyay hwtay takh wh hkmrany nh krtay۔"""""
"3699","ghalb alqtan nay ayk shkhs ka hwalh dya js nay apnay wald ky snd say byan kya kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \srdar ka ahdh zrwry hay، lwgwn kay lyay srdar hwna zrwry hay، lykn srdar jhnm myn jayyn gay۔\""* abw daod nay asay nql kya hay۔ *myrqat۔ iv، 133 khta hay kh as say mrad wh lwg hyn jw naansafy krtay hyn، ya an kay dftr say pyda hwnay waly naansafy kay ftnwn kay khlaf antbah hay۔"""""
"3700","kab b۔ ajrh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say frmaya kh myn tmhyn khda kay sprd krta hwn kh wh tmhyn bay wqwfwn ky hkmrany say bchayay۔ as nay pwchha kh wh kya hay tw rswl allh nay jwab dya kh myray dwr kay bad aysay gwrnr pyda hwn gay jn kay jhwt pr yqyn kya jayay ga awr an kay zlm myn mdd krnay walay an ky mwjwdgy myn dakhl hwn gay، an ka mjh say kwyy talq nhyn awr myra an say kwyy talq nhyn awr wh kbhy myray pas talab pr nhyn atryn gay، lykn jw lwg an ky mwjwdgy myn nhyn aatay، myn an kay jhwtay awr mjh pr zlm krnay walwn say talq rkhta hwn awr an ky mdd krnay walwn say talq rkhta hwn۔ jw myray pas hwz pr atryn gay۔\* asay trmzy awr nsayy nay nql kya hay۔ *yh wh hwz ya hwz hay js myn qyamt kay dn mwmnyn pyyyn gay۔"""""
"3701","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: shra myn rhnay wala khrdra hw jayay ga، pychha krnay wala ghafl hw jayay ga awr jw ksy hakm kay pas jayay ga wh gmrah hw jayay ga۔ asay ahmd، trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔ abwdaod ka qwl hay kh \jw shkhs apnay aap kw ksy hkmran say jwrta hay wh gmrah hw jata hay، awr aadmy hkmran kay jtna qryb aata hay wh khda say atna hy dwr jata hay۔\"""""""
"3702","almqdm b۔ madykryb nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an kay kndhay pr mara awr frmaya: \qdym، agr tm bghyr hakm، sykrtry ya srdar kay mray tw tm kamyab hw jao gay۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ * yh shkl mqdam kay ayk chhwtay kay twr pr astamal hwty hay، adnyٰ kw mkhatb ky pyary shkl kay twr pr astamal kya jata hay۔"""""
"3703","aqbh by۔ aamr nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sahb mks yany lwgwn kw dswan hsh dynay wala jnt myn nhyn jayay ga۔ ahmd، abwdaod awr darmy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3704","abwsayd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn jw allh kay nzdyk sb say zyadh mhbwb awr as kay qryb hw ga wh aadl amam hw ga، awr jw qyamt kay dn allh kay nzdyk sb say zyadh napsndydh hw ga awr asay skht tryn sza mlay gy (ya jysa kh rwayt hay، mqam myn as say sb say zyadh dwr hw ga) amam amamt hw ga۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3705","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka arshad nql kya hay kh ’’bhtryn jhad wh hay jb kwyy zalm hkmran kay samnay schy bat khay۔‘‘ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3706","ahmd awr nsayy nay asay tarq bn ahmd ky snd say rwayt kya hay۔ shhab۔"
"3707","sydh aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb allh taalyٰ ksy hakm kay lyay nyk aradh rkhta hay tw as kay lyay ayk mkhls wzyr mqrr krta hay jw bhwl jayay tw asay yad dlata hay awr agr wh yad krta hay tw as ky mdd krta hay، lykn jb allh taalyٰ as kay lyay as say mkhtlf aradh rkhta hay tw as kay lyay ayk bray wzyr kw mqrr kr dyta hay jw bhwl jayay tw asay yad nhyn krta awr agr wh yad kray tw as ky mdd nhyn krta۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3708","abw amamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kwyy hkmran lwgwn pr alzam lgana chahta hay tw wh an kw bgar dyta hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3709","maawyh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: ”jb tm lwgwn kay razwn kw dykhtay hw tw an kw bgar dytay hw۔“ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔ * yh dwsray lwgwn kay maamlat myn jhanknay awr aysy chyzwn kw zahr krnay ky mmanat hay jw zahr nhyn ky jany chahyyn kywnkh as say an ky zndgy mshkl hwjaty hay۔ yh why khyal hay jw pchhly rwayt myn hay۔"
"3710","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry wfat kay bad tm an amamwn kay sath kya slwk krw gay jw as ghnymt kw apnay lyay mnasb smjhtay hyn؟ as nay jwab dya kh myn as zat ky qsm kha kr khta hwn js nay aap kw hq kay sath bhyja hay kh myn apny tlwar apnay kndhay pr rkhwn ga awr aap say mlnay tk asay marwn ga۔ as nay kha kya myn tmhyn as say bhtr chyz ky rhnmayy nh krwn jb tk tm mjh say nh mlw sbr krw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3711","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kya tm jantay hw kh qyamt kay dn sb say phlay allh kay sayay myn kwn jayay ga jw azym awr bzrg hay؟ phr yh jwab mlnay pr kh khda awr as ka rswl bhtr jantay hyn، aap nay frmaya: ’’wh lwg jnhyn jb hq dya jayay tw wh qbwl krtay hyn، jb kwyy chyz mangy jaty hay tw wh bay drygh dytay hyn awr jw dwsrwn kay hq myn fyslh krtay hyn jysa kh wh apnay lyay krtay hyn۔‘‘ ahmd۔"
"3712","jabr by۔ smrh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: \myn apny qwm kay lyay tyn chyzwn say drta hwn: starwn say barsh tlb krna، hkmran ky naansafy، awr allh kay hkm ka ankar۔\"" ahmd۔ *yh aslam say phlay ky aadt ky trf asharh hay kh barsh kw baz mwsmwn say mnswb kya jata hay awr kha jata hay kh barsh ksy khas staray ky wjh say aayy hay، jbkh mslmanwn kw yh tslym krna chahyay kh barsh khda kay fzl say hwty hay۔"""""
"3713","abwzr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay chh dn tk an say frmaya: ”abw zr smjh lw kh bad myn tm say kya kha jayay ga۔ phr jb satwan dn aaya tw as nay kha kh myn tmhyn nsyht krta hwn kh chhpay awr khlay khda say drw، jb tm ghlt kam krw tw kwyy nyky krw، ksy say kchh nh mangw، chahay tmhara kwra hy kywn nh lgay، amant nh lw، awr dw aadmywn kay drmyan fyslh nh krw۔ ahmd۔ * as ka mtlb yh hay kh mdd srf khda say mangny hay awr ksy ansan say chhwty say chhwty mdd bhy nhyn mangny chahyay۔"
"3714","abw amamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kwyy shkhs ds ya as say zyadh lwgwn pr hkwmt nhyn kray ga jw qyamt kay dn allh kay pas aayay ga jw as kay glay myn hath bandhay ga awr as ky nyky say aazad hw ga ya as kay gnah say hlak hw jayay ga، as ka aaghaz mlamt ka hay، as ka drmyan myn ndamt hay awr as ka anjam rswayy kay dn hay۔ ahmd۔"
"3715","maawyh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tm ksy mnsb pr fayz hw، tw allh say drw awr ansaf krw۔ anhwn nay kha kh wh yh swchtay rhay kh wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay khay kay mtabq gwrnr shp ka shkar hw jayyn gay jb tk kh yh hqyqt nhyn bn jaty۔ ahmd۔ byhqy nay dlayl alnbw myn maawyh ky rwayt nql ky hay۔"
"3716","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: str sal ky abtdaa awr lrkwn ky hkwmt say allh ky pnah mangw۔ *yh rwayt baz bny amyh kay khlaf hay۔"
"3717","yhyyٰ by۔ hashm nay ywns by ka hwalh dya۔ abw ashaq js nay apnay wald ky trf say rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: jysay tm hw، tm pr hkmran mqrr hwn gay۔ byhqy nay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔ as rwayt ky snd twty hwyy hay awr as ky snd zayf hay۔"
"3718","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sltan zmyn pr allh ka sayh hay kh as kay hr bnday pr zlm kya jata hay، jb wh adl krta hay tw as kay lyay ajr hwta hay، awr aam lwgwn ka frz hay kh wh as ka shkr ada kray، lykn jb wh zlm krta hay tw as ka bwjh asy pr prta hay، awr aam lwgwn pr as ka anjam dyna frz hay۔ byhqy nay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"3719","amr by۔ alkhtab rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn allh kay bndwn myn say js ka mqam allh kay nzdyk sb say achha hw ga wh aadl awr mhrban ayman wala hw ga، lykn qyamt kay dn allh kay nzdyk sb say bra mqam rkhnay wala zalm awr skht amam hw ga۔ byhqy nay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"3720","abdallh by۔ amrw rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs apnay bhayy kw aysy nzr dalay js say wh dray tw allh taalyٰ asay qyamt kay dn khwfzdh kray ga۔ byhqy nay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"3721","hzrt abw drdaa rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh allh taalyٰ frmata hay kh myn wh khda hwn js kay swa kwyy mabwd nhyn، badshahwn ka malk، badshahwn ka badshah، js kay hath myn badshahwn kay dl hyn، jb lwg myry bat mantay hyn tw myn an ky trf rhmt awr nrmy kay sath badshahwn kay dlwn kw phyr dyta hwn، lykn jb wh myry nafrmany krtay hyn tw myn an kay dlwn kw naraz kr dyta hwn awr an say naraz hw jata hwn۔ an pr azab hay tw badshahwn pr lant bhyjnay myn mshghwl nh hw jao blkh myray zkr awr daa myn mshghwl rhw kh myn tmharay badshahwn say tmhary hfazt krwn۔ abw naym nay asay hlyh myn nql kya hay۔"
"3722","hzrt abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay ayk sathy kw an kay ksy kam myn shrkt kay lyay bhyja tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwgw khwsh hw jao awr anhyn nh draw، aasan krw awr mshkl nh krw۔‘‘ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3723","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”chyzwn kw aasan krw awr mshkl nh krw، lwgwn kw prskwn krw awr anhyn nh draw۔‘‘ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3724","abw brdh* byan krtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay dada abw mwsyٰ awr maaz kw ymn bhyja tw aap nay frmaya: chyzwn kw aasan krw awr mshkl nh krw، khwsh hw jao awr khwfzdh nh hw، ayk dwsray ky ataat krw awr akhtlaf nh krw۔ (bkhary wmslm)* yh sayd bn hwna chahyay۔ abw brdh apnay wald kay hkm say۔ sy ayf۔ bkhary، mghazy، 60۔"
"3725","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khyant krnay walay kay lyay qyamt kay dn ayk mayar mqrr kya jayay ga awr aalan kya jayay ga kh yh flan flan ky ghybt hay“۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) * as ky wzaht as ky bay wfayy ky alamt، ntyjh ya sza kay twr pr ky gyy hay۔"
"3726","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr khyant krnay walay kay lyay qyamt kay dn ayk mayar hwga js say wh phchana jayay ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3727","abwsayd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn hr khyant krnay walay kay mqad myn ayk mayar hwga۔ ayk rwayt myn hay kh \qyamt kay dn hr khyant krnay walay kay lyay ayk mayar hwga jw as kay khyant ky mqdar kay mtabq as kay lyay blnd kya jayay ga، awr ksy qwm kay hakm say zyadh khyant krnay wala kwyy nhyn hwga۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3728","amrw by۔ mrh nay byan kya kh anhwn nay maawyh say kha kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh agr ksy kw allh taalyٰ nay mslmanwn kay ksy maamlay pr akhtyar dya awr an ky hajt، tngdsty awr mflsy say aaraz kya tw allh taalyٰ as ky hajt، tngdsty awr mflsy kw dwr kr day ga۔ phr maawyh nay lwgwn ky zrwryat kw pwra krnay kay lyay ayk aadmy kw mqrr kya۔ asay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔ ahmd awr trmzy ka ayk nskhh hay، \khda as ky tngdsty، zrwrt awr ghrbt pr jnt kay drwazay bnd kr day ga۔\"""""""
"3729","abwshmkh alazdy kw an kay wald ky trf say an kay ayk chcha zad bhayy nay jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sathy thay، btaya kh wh maawyh kay pas gyay، an kay pas aayay awr anhyn btaya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh js kw lwgwn pr kwyy akhtyar dya gya hay wh mslmanwn kay khlaf apnay drwazay kw bnd kr day ga، ya js pr zlm hwa hay، ya js kw allh taalyٰ kay drwazay ky zrwrt hw gy wh as pr bnd kr day ga۔ zrwrt mnd hay ya ghryb hay، chahay wh as ka ktna hy mhtaj hw۔\ byhqy nay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"""""
"3730","jb amr bn alkhtab nay apnay gwrnr bhyjay awr an pr yh shrt rkhy kh wh arby nsl kay ghwray pr swar nh hwn، sfyd rwty nh khayyn، amdh lbas nh phnyn، ya lwgwn ky zrwrtwn kay khlaf apnay drwazay bnd kryn، an say kha kh agr anhwn nay an myn say kwyy kam kya tw an pr azab aayay ga۔ phr wh kchh dwr an kay sath jata۔ byhqy nay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔ *brdhwn۔ yh lfz ghryb nsl kay ghwray kay lyay astamal hwta hay، aysa ghwra jw arb nsl ka nhyn، ya khas twr pr trky kay ghwray kay lyay۔ yh tjwyz kya jata hay kh alfaz ky wjh gwrnrwn kw ghwrwn ky swary say khbrdar krna hay، yh fkhr ky alamt hay۔ dwsray drjay ky smjhy janay waly nsl ky mmanat say yh zahr hwta hay kh bhtryn arb nsl kay ghwrwn pr swar hwna as say bhy bra fkhr ky alamt hay۔"
"3731","abwbkrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”kwyy qazy dw aadmywn kay drmyan jb wh ghsay myn hw tw fyslh nh kray۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3732","abdallh by۔ sydna amrw awr abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb qazy shyh awr drst fyslh krnay ky pwry kwshsh kr kay fyslh day ga tw asay dwhra ajr mlay ga، awr jb wh shyh awr ghlt fyslh krnay ky pwry kwshsh kr kay fyslh day ga tw asay ayk hy ajr mlay ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3733","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js kw lwgwn myn qazy bnaya gya asay bghyr chhry kay qtl kr dya gya۔“* asay ahmd، trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔ *as jmlay nay mfsryn kw pryshan kr dya hay۔ shayd sb say bhtr twjyhh yh hay kh as kay pas apnay trzِ zndgy say twbh krnay ky wjh hw gy، kywnkh bht sy rwayat aysy hyn jw as trh kay ahdh snbhalnay ky napsndydgy ka azhar krty hyn۔ ayk qdray zhyn wzaht yh hay kh as ky brayy khswsyat kw khtm kr dyna chahyay، yh ayk qsm ka zbyhh hay۔"
"3734","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy shkhs qza ka ahdh tlb kray ga tw asay as ky apny mrzy pr chhwr dya jayay ga، lykn agr kwyy asay qbwl krnay pr mjbwr hw jayay ga tw allh taalyٰ ayk aysa zawyh nazl kray ga jw asay hdayt day ga۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3735","brydh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: qadyan tyn qsm kay hyn، jn myn say ayk jnt myn jayay ga awr dw jhnm myn، jnt myn janay wala wh hay jw hq kw janta hw awr as kay mtabq fyslh krta hw، lykn wh shkhs jw hq kw janta hw awr apnay fyslay myn zlm krta hw wh jhnm myn jayay ga، awr wh shkhs jw lwgwn kay hq myn fyslh kray ga، wh jnt myn jayay ga۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3736","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs mslmanwn myn qazy ka ahdh tlash kray yhan tk kh asay hasl hw jayay awr as ka adl as kay zlm pr ghalb hw jayay tw wh jnt myn jayay ga awr js shkhs ka zlm as kay adl pr ghalb hw ga wh jhnm myn jayay ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3737","maaz b۔ jbl nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn ymn bhyja tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an say pwchha kh jb mwqa aayay ga tw aap kysay fyslh kryn gay، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh allh ky ktab kay mtabq fyslh kryn gay۔ as nay pwchha kh agr khda ky ktab myn hdayt nh mlay tw wh kya kray ga، tw as nay jwab dya kh wh khda kay rswl ky snt kay mtabq aml kray ga۔ as nay pwchha kh agr wh khda kay rswl ky snt myn kwyy rhnmayy nh pa skay tw wh kya kray ga، awr as nay jwab dya kh wh apny rayay qaym krnay ky pwry kwshsh kryn gay awr kwyy tklyf nhyn chhwryn gay۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as kay synh pr thpthpaya awr frmaya: allh ka shkr hay js nay apnay rswl sly allh alyh wslm kw aysy chyz say nwaza js say rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm khwsh hwyay! asay trmzy، abwdaod awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3738","aly rzy allh anh nay kha: mjhay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ymn ky trf qazy bna kr bhyja awr myn nay arz kya: allh kay rswl kya aap mjhay as wqt bhyj rhay hyn jb myn jwan hwn awr mjhay qza kay frayz ka alm nhyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khda tmharay dl kw hdayt day ga awr tmhary zban kw scha rkhay ga۔ jb dw aadmy aap kay samnay kwyy mqdmh lay kr aayyn tw phlay kay hq myn fyslh nh kryn jb tk aap sn nh lyn kh dwsray ka kya khna hay، kywnkh bhtr yhy hay kh aap kw bhtryn fyslay ka wazh andazh hw۔‘‘ anhwn nay kha kh bad myn ksy fyslay kay baray myn kwyy shk nhyn hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3739","abdallh by۔ hzrt msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kwyy qazy jw aadmywn kay drmyan fyslh snayay ga qyamt kay dn aysa nhyn hw ga kh as ky grdn kay pychhay frshth hw، phr wh apna sr aasman ky trf athayay ga، awr agr allh taalyٰ asay granay ka hkm day ga tw asay chalys sal tk ghry khayy myn phynk day ga۔ asay ahmd، abn majh awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔ *yany frshth"
"3740","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt ka dn aadl qazy kay pas aayay ga awr wh kash dw aadmywn kay drmyan ayk tarykh ka fyslh nh kr dyta۔“* asay ahmd nay nql kya۔ *as ky khwahsh hwgy kh as nay kbhy anthayy mamwly maamlat kay baray myn bhy fyslh nh kya hwta۔"
"3741","abdallh by abw awfy rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khda as wqt tk qazy kay sath hay jb tk kh wh zalm nh hw، lykn jb wh hwta hay tw as say dwr hw jata hay awr shytan as kay sath jr jata hay۔ ayk wrzhn hay، \jb wh zalm hwta hay tw wh asay as kay apnay aalat pr chhwr dyta hay۔\"" asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3742","kha by۔ almsyb nay byan kya kh ayk mslman awr ayk yhwdy nay hzrt amr rzy allh anh kay samnay jhgra kya awr wh yhwdy kw hq pr smjhtay hwyay as kay hq myn fyslh snaya۔ lykn jb yhwdy nay kha، \myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh tm nay ansaf ka fyslh snaya hay،\"" tw as nay asay kwray say mara awr as say pwchha kh asay yh malwm hwnay ky wjh kya hay۔ yhwdy nay jwab dya kh khda ky qsm hmyn twrat myn mlta hay kh kwyy bhy qazy shyh fyslh nhyn krta jb tk kh as kay dayyn hath pr frshth nh hw awr as kay bayyn hath pr frshth nh hw jw as ky rhnmayy krta hay awr jb tk wh dahny trf rhta hay asay shyh ky trf mbaws krta hay lykn jb wh dayyn kw chhwr dyta hay tw wh asay chhwr dytay hyn۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3743","abn mhb nay byan kya kh jb asman bn afan nay abn amr say kha kh wh lwgwn kay drmyan qady ky hysyt say kam kryn as nay wfadarwn kay kmandr say maafy mangy۔ as nay as say pwchha kh jb as kay wald aysay ahdh pr fayz thay tw asay as pr kya aatraz hay tw as nay jwab dya kh yh as lyay hay kh as nay rswl allh ﷺ kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh agr kwyy qady hay awr as mnsb kw ansaf kay sath ada krta hay tw asay chahyay kh wh as say mnh mwr lay awr nh kwyy alzam۔ as kay bad as nay phr nhyn pwchha۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3744","nafa ky rwayt pr rzyn ka byan hay kh abn amr nay asman say kha: \ayman kay srdar، myn dw aadmywn kay drmyan fyslh nhyn krwn ga۔\"" as nay jwab dya tmharay wald bhy aysa krtay thay۔ anhwn nay kha kh myray wald kw kwyy chyz mshtbh thy tw anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say mangy awr agr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw kwyy chyz mshtbh thy tw jbrayyl alyh alslam say mangy lykn mjhay kwyy pwchhnay wala nhyn mla awr myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh js nay allh ky pnah mangy as nay azym ky pnah mangy۔ tw as nay asay maaf kr dya lykn kha kh ksy kw mt btana۔ razyn۔"""""
"3745","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw kchh myn tmhyn dyta hwn awr jw tm say nhyn rwkta، myn asay whyn tqsym kr rha hwn jhan mjhay hkm dya gya hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3746","khwlh alansaryh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwg nahq apnay lyay wh mal hasl kryn gay jw allh ka hay، awr qyamt kay dn wh jhnm myn jayyn gay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3747","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jb abwbkr rzy allh anh khlyfh hwyay tw anhwn nay kha kh myry qwm kw malwm hay kh myry tjart myray khandan ky kfalt kay qabl nhyn thy، lykn myn mslmanwn kay maamlat myn mshghwl hw gya hwn، as lyay abwbkr rzy allh anh kay khandan ky kfalt as jayydad say ky jayay gy jb kh wh mslmanwn ky trf say as kay lyay kam kryn gay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3748","brydh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb hm ksy kw ksy antzamy ahday pr mqrr krtay hyn awr asay alaons dytay hyn، tw wh as say brh kr jw kchh bhy lyta hay wh bay wfayy hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3749","amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn ayk antzamy ahdh pr fayz tha، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay as ka maawzh dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3750","maaz rzy allh anh nay kha: mjhay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ymn bhyja، lykn jb myn rwanh hwa tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay myray pychhay bhyja awr mjhay waps laya gya۔ phr frmaya tm jantay hw kh myn nay tmhyn kywn bhyja hay myry ajazt kay bghyr kwyy chyz nh lyna kywnkh yh bay wfayy hay awr jw bay wfayy kray ga wh qyamt kay dn as ky bay wfayy kay sath aayay ga asy lyay myn nay tmhyn blaya hay ab tm apnay kam pr chlw۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3751","almstdrd b۔ shdad nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh jw hmaray lyay gwrnr bnay asay bywy mlny chahyay، agr as kay pas nwkr nhyn hay tw asay ayk mlny chahyay، awr agr as kay pas mkan nhyn hay tw asay zrwr mlay gy۔ ayk wrzhn khta hay، \jw as kay alawh kchh bhy lyta hay wh bay wfayy kr rha hay۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3752","ady by۔ amyrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tm lwgwn myn say ksy kw hmary trf say kwyy antzamy ahdh dya jayay awr wh hm say swyy ya as say zyadh chhpayay tw as nay khyant ky hay awr asay qyamt kay dn lay aayay ga۔ phr ayk ansar nay ath kr kha kh ya rswl allh، mjh say myra ahdh waps lay lyn۔ as nay pwchha kh as ka kya mtlb hay awr as nay btaya kh as nay asay flan flan khtay sna hay۔ as nay jwab dya، \awr myn yh khta hwn kh agr hm ksy kw ksy dftr pr mqrr kryn tw asay chahyay kh as say jw kchh mnslk hw، wh lay kr aayay، chahay wh thwra awr zyadh hw، asay jw dya jayay wh lay skta hay، lykn asay as say baz rhna chahyay jw as say dwr rkha gya hay۔\"" asay mslm awr abwdaod nay nql kya hay، alfaz bad kay hyn۔"""""
"3753","abdallh by amrw nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay rshwt dynay walay awr rshwt lynay walay pr lant frmayy hay۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
