"3755","ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn asay swban ky snd say nql kya hay، anhwn nay mzyd kha kh rsht kay slslay myn rshtah hay۔"
"3756","amrw by۔ aas rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay hkm bhyja kh myn apnay hthyar awr kpray jma kr kay as kay pas aao۔ myn as kay pas as wqt aaya jb wh wzw kr rha tha tw as nay kha kh myn nay amrw kw aap kay pas blaya hay kh aap kw ayk aysay maamlay pr bhyjwn js myn allh aap kw mhfwz rkhay ga awr aap kw ghnymt ata kray ga awr myn aap kw ghnymt myn say hsh dwn ga۔ myn nay arz kya، ya rswl allh، myry hjrt jayydad ky khatr nhyn thy، blkh srf khda awr as kay rswl ky khatr thy۔ as nay kha، ’’aymandar aadmy kay lyay aymandar jayydad achhy hay۔‘‘ yh shrh shrh alsn myn mnqwl hay awr ahmd nay bhy kchh aysa hy nql kya hay۔ as kay wrzhn myn \ayk aymandar aadmy kay lyay achhy hay aymandaranh jayydad 2۔\"" 1. naymh bl mal alsalh۔ 2. nam almal alsalh۔"""""
"3757","abw amamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs sfarsh kray، awr wh asay thfh day jsay wh qbwl kr lay، tw wh sngyn qsm kay swd ka mrtkb hwa“۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3758","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr lwgwn kw why dya jayay jw wh mqdmh pysh krtay wqt mangtay thay tw kchh lwg dwsrwn ky jan w mal ka dawyٰ krtay thay، lykn qsm mdaa alyh ky trf say lyny chahyay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ nwwy nay apny tsnyf ky tfsyr myn kha hay kh byhqy ky snd kay sath jw kh hsn ya shyh hay as myn abn abas rzy allh anh ky snd myn ayk azafh hay jw kh nby sly allh alyh wslm say mnqwl hay، \lykn dlyl mday pr hay awr as ky qsm athana zrwry hay jw dawyٰ kw rd kray۔\"""""""
"3759","abn msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw kwyy pkhth qsm khayay، 1 as kay zryaay brayy kray awr as kay zryaay ksy mslman ka mal tsrf kray، tw allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn as say mlaqat kay wqt naraz hw ga۔ awr allh taalyٰ nay as ky tsdyq nazl frmayy hay kh ’’jw lwg mamwly qymt pr khda kay ahd awr apny qsmwn ka swda krtay hyn‘‘۔ (bkhary w mslm) 1. ya wh qsm athanay pr mjbwr hay۔ 2. alqraan، 3:77"
"3760","abw amamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs apny qsm kay zryaay ksy mslman kay hq myn hq ada kray tw allh taalyٰ nay as kay lyay jhnm kw lazm kr dya awr asay jnt say mhrwm kr dya۔ ayk aadmy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh kya yh thwry mqdar myn bhy lagw hwta hay، tw aap nay frmaya: khwah wh arq kay drkht ky chhry hy kywn nh hw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3761","am slmh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn srf ayk ansan hwn awr tm apnay jhgray myray pas latay hw، shayd kchh dwsrwn kay mqablay myn zyadh fsyh hw، takh myn an ky trf say jw kchh myn an say snta hwn as kay mtabq fyslh krwn، lhza myn jw bhy fyslh krwn jw as kay bhayy ka hq hay، asay qbwl nhyn krna chahyay، kywnkh myn asay srf as ka hq dyta hwn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3762","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh kay nzdyk sb say zyadh nfrt krnay wala wh hay jw jhgra awr jhgra kray۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3763","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay qsm awr ayk gwah ky bnyad pr fyslh dya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3764","alqmh b۔ wayl nay apnay wald ky snd say btaya kh hzrmwt ka ayk aadmy awr kndh ka aadmy nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya، hzrmy nay kha، \khda kay rswl، as shkhs nay myry zmyn pr qbzh kr lya hay\"" awr kndy nay kha: \""yh myry zmyn hay awr myray qbzay myn hay۔ as ka as pr kwyy hq nhyn hay۔\"" nby sly allh alyh wslm nay hzrmy say pwchha kh kya aap kay pas kwyy sbwt hay، lykn as nay jwab dya kh as kay pas kwyy sbwt nhyn hay، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay btaya kh wh dwsray kw bhy qsm day skta hay۔ as nay jwab dya، \""khda kay rswl، wh shkhs mlamt krnay wala hay jw ksy bhy chyz ky qsm khata hay awr ksy chyz pr qaym nhyn rhta hay\"" lykn as nay asay btaya kh as ka wahd shara hay۔ wh shkhs byat krnay kay lyay chla gya، awr jb as nay pyth phyr ly tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr wh apnay mal kay baray myn nahq qsm khayay tw jb wh as say mlay ga tw yqynaً allh kw as say mnh phyrta hwa payay ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3765","abwzr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”agr kwyy dawyٰ kray kh jw as ka nhyn hay wh hm myn say nhyn hay، awr asay jhnm myn apnay thkanay pr aana chahyay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3766","zyd by۔ khald rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya myn tmhyn bhtryn gwah kay baray myn nh btaon؟ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3767","abn msawd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bhtryn lwg myry nsl hyn، phr wh jw an kay bad aayyn gay، phr wh jw an kay bad aayyn gay، as kay bad aysay lwg aayyn gay jw qsm khanay say phlay gwahy dyn gay awr gwahy dynay say phlay qsm khayyn gay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3768","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay kchh lwgwn kw qsm khanay ka mshwrh dya awr jb anhwn nay jldy ky tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay hkm dya kh an kay drmyan qsm kay baray myn qrah andazy ky jayay kh ks ky qsm khayy jayay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3769","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky snd say byan kya kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \sbwt mday pr hay awr qsm mdaa alyh ky trf say khayy jayay gy۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3770","am slmh rzy allh anha nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say dw aadmywn kay baray myn btaya، jw aap kay samnay wrast ka jhgra lay kr aayay، lykn an kay pas an kay daway say zyadh kwyy dlyl nhyn thy۔ as nay kha kh agr myn ksy kay hq myn fyslh dyta hwn kh as kay bhayy kay hq ka ahtram kya jayay tw myn asay jhnm ka ayk hsh hy day rha hwn۔ tw dwnwn aadmywn nay kha: \khda kay rswl، myra yh hq myray bhayy kw ja skta hay\"" lykn as nay jwab dya: \""nhyn، blkh ja kr as kw tqsym kr kay hq ky trf mtwjh hw jao، phr qrah dalw، awr tm myn say hr ayk dwsray kw smjhay kh jw as ka hay wh jayz hay۔\"" ayk rwayt myn frmaya kh myn tmharay drmyan srf apny rayay say an amwr myn fyslh krta hwn jn kay baray myn mjh pr kwyy why nazl nhyn hwyy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3771","jabr by۔ abdallh nay btaya kh dw aadmywn nay ayk janwr ka dawyٰ kya awr dwnwn nay as bat ka sbwt pysh kya kh yh as ka janwr hay، as kay ksy janwr ky awlad hay۔ khda kay rswl nay phr fyslh dya kh yh as kay pas jayay js kay pas yh hay۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"3772","abw mwsyٰ ashary rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn dw aadmywn nay ayk awnt ka dawyٰ kya awr dwnwn nay dw dw gwah bhyjay، tw nby sly allh alyh wslm nay asay an kay drmyan aadhay hsay myn tqsym kr dya۔ nsayy، abn majh awr as ky rwayt hay kh dw aadmywn nay ayk awnt ka dawyٰ kya، lykn an myn say kwyy bhy sbwt pysh nh krska، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh anhyn brabr shryk hwna chahyay۔ * myn nay as trjmay myn arby kw qryb say rkha hay kywnkh mtbadl wrzhn as kay fwraً bad aata hay۔ dwnwn nskhwn ka mfhwm ayk hy hay، yany۔ kh dwnwn aadmywn kw awnt ka brabr astamal krna tha۔"
"3773","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh dw aadmywn nay ayk janwr kay baray myn jhgra kya lykn kwyy dlyl pysh nh kr skay، tw nby sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: qsm kay baray myn qrah dalw۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3774","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy say frmaya js say aap nay qsm athanay kw kha tha kh qsm khao as khda ky js kay swa kwyy mabwd nhyn kh tyra kchh bhy as ka nhyn hay yany mday۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3775","alaashs by۔ qys nay kha: ayk yhwdy awr myn nay kchh zmyn bant dy awr as nay myray hq say ankar kya tw myn asay nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas lay gya aap nay mjh say pwchha kh kya myray pas kwyy dlyl hay؟ jb myn nay jwab dya kh myray pas kwyy nhyn hay awr as nay yhwdy kw qsm khanay kw kha tw myn nay kha: \khda kay rswl، wh qsm khayay ga awr myra mal lay kr chla jayay ga۔\"" phr khdayay bzrg w brtr nay nazl kya، \""wh lwg jw khda kay ahd awr apny qsmwn kw thwry qymt pr khrydtay hyn۔\"" (alqraan، 3:77) abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3776","as nay btaya kh ayk qsm ka aadmy awr hzrmwt ka ayk aadmy ymn myn zmyn kay baray myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay samnay jhgra lay kr aaya۔ hzrmy nay kha، \khda kay rswl، as shkhs kay bap nay myry zmyn mjh say zbrdsty chhyn ly، awr yh as kay hath myn hay۔\"" as nay as say pwchha kh kya as kay pas kwyy sbwt hay، tw as nay jwab dya، \""nhyn، lykn myn as say mtalbh krwn ga kh wh khda ky qsm khayay، wh nhyn janta kh yh myry zmyn hay jw as kay bap nay mjh say zbrdsty chhyn ly thy۔\"" kndy hlf athanay kay lyay tyar tha، lykn jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya، ’’jw shkhs qsm kha kr jayydad ka tayn kray ga wh khsth halt myn allh say mlay ga،‘‘ kndy nay kha، ’’yh as ky zmyn hay۔‘‘ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3777","abdallh by۔ anys rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sb say bray gnahwn myn say ksy kw shryk thhrana، ghyr shray slwk awr jan bwjh kr jhwt bwlna hay، agr kwyy aysy qsm khayay js pr wh mjbwr hw (ya pkhth qsm) awr as myn mchhr kay bazw kay brabr jhwt dalay، tw as kay dl myn qyamt tk ka dagh lga dya jayay ga۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3778","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs myray as mnbr kay qryb jhwty qsm khayay، agrchh wh sbz dantwn ky chhry kay brabr hy kywn nh hw، wh apnay thkanay jhnm myn jayay ga“ ya yh kh ”wh yqynaً jhnm myn jayay ga۔ malk، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"3779","khrym aay۔ fatk nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm sbh ky nmaz say fargh hwyay tw aap khray hwyay awr tyn mrtbh frmaya: jhwty gwahy allh kay sath ksy kw shryk thhranay kay mtradf hay، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay yh tlawt frmayy: \ps btwn ky nafrmany say bchw awr allh kay lyay khals ayman walay bn kr jhwt phylanay say bchw، as kay sath ksy kw shryk nh krw۔\"" majh nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3780","ahmd awr trmzy nay asay aymn bn ky snd say rwayt kya hay۔ khrym۔ abn majh nay jw kchh prha as ka zkr nhyn kya۔"
"3781","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dhwkay baz mrd ya awrt ky ya allh ky mqrr krdh hdwn say tjawz krnay walay ky ya apnay bhayy say bghz rkhnay walay ky، ya ksy aysay shkhs ky gwahy dyna jn ka wh dawyٰ krta hay ya rshth dar hay، ya aysay shkhs ky gwahy jayz nhyn hay jw khandan ka mhtaj hw۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay awr yzyd bn ky rwayt hay۔ zyad aldmshqy، transmytr، kw mstrd kr dya gya hay۔"
"3782","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky snd say byan kya kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh: \dhwkay baz mrd ya awrt، ya fasq mrd ya awrt، ya apnay bhayy kay khlaf bghz rkhnay walay ky gwahy jayz nhyn hay،\"" awr anhwn nay as shkhs ky gwahy kw rd kr dya jw khandan ka mhtaj hw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3783","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy arb ky shhr kay khlaf gwahy jayz nhyn۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3784","awf by۔ malk rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay dw aadmywn kay drmyan fyslh dya awr js kay khlaf fyslh dya gya tha jb wh mkr gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myra kfyl allh hay awr achha wly hay۔ as kay bad rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh sb say zyadh kmy ka alzam lgata hay، aql ka astamal krw، awr jb kwyy maamlh bhtr hw jayay tw khw kh myry kfayt allh hay، awr achha wly hay“ (alqraan، 3:173) abw daod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3785","bhz b۔ hkym nay apnay wald ky trf say kha kh an kay dada nay btaya kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk shkhs kw shk ky bna pr qyd kr dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay، awr trmzy awr nsayy nay mzyd kha hay kh bad myn asay janay dw۔"
"3786","abdallh by۔ az zbyr nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh dya kh dwnwn mkhalfwn kw jj kay samnay btha dya jayay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3787","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs allh awr as kay rswl pr ayman rkhta hay، nmaz awr rmzan kay rwzay rkhta hay، allh asay zrwr jnt myn dakhl kray ga، chahay as nay allh ky rah myn jhad kya hw ya as ky srzmyn myn rha hw js myn wh pyda hwa tha۔ yh pwchhay janay pr kh kya lwgwn kw yh khwshkhbry nh dy jayay tw aap nay jwab dya kh jnt myn sw drjay hyn jw allh nay rah khda myn jhad krnay walwn kay lyay tyar kr rkhay hyn jn kay hr jwray kay drmyan zmyn w aasman kay brabr faslh hay، ps jb tm allh say frdws mangw tw as say frdws mangw، kywnkh yh jnt ka sb say bhtryn awr blnd tryn hsh hay، as kay awpr ayk drya hay، as kay awpr jnt ka drya hay۔ jnt ka msylh\ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3788","anhwn nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw allh ky rah myn jhad krta hay wh as shkhs ky trh hay jw rwzay rkhta hay awr ratyn nmaz prhta hay، jw allh ky aayat ky tlawt krta hay awr rwzay awr nmaz say as wqt tk ssty nhyn krta jb tk kh allh ky rah myn jhad krnay wala waps nh aajayay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3789","as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw byan krtay hwyay kha: \khda as ky mghfrt ky daa ka jwab dyta hay jw as kay rastay myn nklta hay، as kay lyay as pr ayman awr as kay rswlwn pr yqyn kay swa kchh nhyn hwta، as kw jw anaam ya mal ghnymt hasl hwta hay asay waps lanay ka wadh krta hay، ya asay jnt myn lay jata hay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3790","anhwn nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، agr yh nh hwta kh mwmnyn myray pychhay rhnay pr razy nh hwn jb myn an kay lyay swary nh kr skwn، tw myn as wqt pychhay nh rhwn ga jb rahِ khda myn nklay ga، as ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، kash myn allh ky rah myn mara jaon، phr zndh kya jaon، phr zndh kya jaon، phr zndh kya jaon“۔ mara gya\ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
