"3793","slman farsy rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”allh ky rah myn srhd pr ayk dn awr ayk rat qyam krna ayk mhynay kay rwzay rkhnay awr as ky ratyn abadt myn gzarnay say bhtr hay، agr kwyy mr jayay tw asay an aamal ka bdlh dya jayay ga jw wh kr rha tha، asay as ka rzq dya jayay ga، awr jw as ky aazmaysh kray ga as say mhfwz rhay ga۔ yhan hwalh kay baray myn kchh shk hay۔ yh shytan hw skta hay، yh nam as lyay astamal kya ja rha hay kh wh lwgwn kw gnah krnay pr aksata hay۔ ya as say mrad wh shkhs hw skta hay jw qbr myn mrdwn ky janch krta hay۔ mnkr awr nqyr kw ftna alqbr kha jata hay، wh dw jw qbr myn mrdwn ka amthan lytay hyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3794","abwabas rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js aadmy kay paon allh ky rah myn ghbar aalwd hwn asay jhnm nhyn chhwyay gy۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3795","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kafr awr as kw qtl krnay wala kbhy jhnm myn aktha nhyn kya jayay ga۔“ * as ka mtlb ghalbaً yh hay kh js nay jhad kay dwran ksy kafr kw qtl kya as ky wjh say as kay gnah maaf hw jayyn gay، awr as lyay wh jhnm myn nhyn jayay ga jhan kafr lazmaً jayay ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3796","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh: \rwzy ky bhtryn aqsam myn say ayk wh shkhs hay jw apnay ghwray ky lgam kw pkray (khda kay rastay awr as ky pyth pr dwryn، as jghwn kay lyay jgh bnata hay jhan maray janay awr mrnay kay lyay zmh dar hyn) jtny bar wh khwfnak chykh ya mdd kay lyay pkarta hay؛ ya ksy aysay shkhs ky jw an myn say chnd awnchy zmynwn pr ya an myn say ksy ayk kay sath nychay ky trf dykhta hay۔ nmaz ada krta hay awr apnay rb ky abadt krta hay yhan tk kh mwt aajayay۔"""""
"3797","zyd by۔ khald rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay khda ky rah myn lrnay walay kw lys kya as nay lrayy myn hsh lya، awr js nay jngjw kay ghr walwn ky dykh bhal ky jb wh bhag gya tw as nay lrayy myn hsh lya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3798","brydh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ghr myn rhnay walwn ky trf say jhad krnay waly awrtwn ky azt wahtram krna chahyay jysa kh an ky maon kay sath hwta hay، agr ghr myn rhnay walwn myn say kwyy mrd as kay ghr walwn ky ngrany jhad myn msrwf hw awr as kay sath khyant kray tw qyamt kay dn as kay lyay as kay lyay mqrr kya jayay ga awr wh qyamt kay dn jw chahay ga۔ aap ka kya khyal hay؟\ *yany as aadmy kay lyay jw as nay dhwkh dya hay asay dhwkh dynay wala۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3799","abwmsawd ansary rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh ayk shkhs ayk awntny kw lay kr aaya js ky nak myn rsy thy awr kha kh yh allh ky rah myn wqf hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn tmhyn as kay bdlay sat sw awntnyan mlyn gy jn myn say hr ayk ky nak myn rsy hw gy۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3800","abw sayd rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay by lhyan ky trf ayk lshkr bhyja jw ayk tbqh ya hzyl thay awr frmaya kh hr dw aadmywn myn say ayk kw bhyja jayay lykn dwnwn kw swab myn shryk hwna chahyay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3801","jabr by۔ smrh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh dyn mslmanwn ky ayk jmaat kay sath as wqt tk qaym nhyn rhay ga jb tk kh as ky trf say aakhry ghry nh aajayay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3802","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh ky rah myn kwyy zkhmy nhyn hwta، awr allh an lwgwn kw khwb janta hay jw as ky rah myn zkhmy hwyay، qyamt kay dn as kay zkhm say khwn nklay ga، js ka rng khwn ka hay lykn khwshbw mshk ky hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3803","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs jnt myn dakhl hw ga wh yh nhyn chahay ga kh wh dnya myn waps jayay awr as kay pas zmyn myn swayay shhyd kay kchh bhy hw، wh dnya myn waps aana chahay ga awr as ky azt ky wjh say asay ds mrtbh qtl kya jayay ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3804","msrwq nay kha: hm nay abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh say pwchha۔ as aayt kay baray myn msawd nay frmaya: ’’jw rah khda myn maray gyay anhyn mrdh nh smjhw، blkh wh apnay rb kay hzwr zndh hyn awr rzq pa rhay hyn‘‘ (alqraan، 3:169)۔ anhwn nay jwab dya kh myn nay as kay baray myn pwchha tha tw nby krym sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh an ky rwhyn sbz prndwn ky khyty myn hyn jn kay arsh say chragh jlay hwyay hyn jw jnt myn jhan chahyn jatay hyn awr phr an chraghwn ky trf lwt jatay hyn، an ka rb an ky trf dykhta hay awr pwchhta hay kh kya an ky khwahsh hay، awr wh jwab myn pwchhtay hyn kh wh kya chahyn gay jb wh jnt myn jayyn gay awr wh tyn mrtbh as trh dykhyn gay kh wh jnt myn jayyn gay۔ kchh pwchhay bghyr akyla nhyn chhwrtay، wh apnay rb say khtay hyn kh wh chahtay hyn kh wh an ky rwhyn an kay jsmwn myn lwta day takh wh ayk bar phr as kay rastay myn maray jayyn phr jb wh dykhta hay kh an kay pas kchh nhyn hay tw wh mzyd pwchh gchh kay bghyr rh jatay hyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3805","abw qtadh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm an kay drmyan athay awr an say frmaya kh allh ky rah myn jhad awr allh pr ayman bhtryn kam hyn۔ ayk aadmy nay ath kr pwchha kh ya rswl allh agr myn rah khda myn mara jaon tw kya myray gnah chhp jayyn gay؟ as nay jwab dya kh han، agr tm khda ky rah myn sbr ka mzahrh krtay hwyay، khda say ajr mangtay hwyay، aagay brhtay hwyay awr pychhay nh httay hwyay maray jao۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh tm nay kya kha؟* as nay jwab dya kh btao agr myn rah khda myn mara jaon tw kya myray gnah chhp jayyn gay؟ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han، jb tm sbr ka mzahrh kr rhay hw، allh say ajr mang rhay hw، aagay brh rhay hw awr pychhay nh ht rhay hw، lykn as myn qrz shaml nhyn hay، kywnkh jbrayyl nay mjhay yh btaya hay۔ *mrqat iv، 176 tby nay apnay swal kw dhranay ky drkhwast ky wzaht kay lyay nql kya hay jb kh jwab phlay hy day dya gya tha۔ mqsd dwsray jwab kay aakhr myn astsnyٰ dyna btaya jata hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3806","abdallh by۔ amrw by۔ alaas nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmaya۔ \khda ky rah myn mara jana qrz kay swa sb kchh chhpa day ga۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3807","Abu Huraira (Radi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke Allah kay Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala do aadmiyon par jo ek doosre ko qatal karte hain"","" muskurata hai.\"" (Yaani unka kaam pasand karta hai). Ek Jannat mein jaata hai"","" doosra bhi Jannat mein jaata hai. Ek Allah ki raah mein jung karta hai aur shaheed ho jata hai"","" phir qaatil ko Allah tauba ki taufeeq deta hai"","" woh musalman ho kar jihad karta hai aur shaheed ho jata hai.\"" (Bukhari aur Muslim)."""""
"3808","shl by۔ hnyf rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs allh taalyٰ say schay araday say shhadt mangta hay، allh taalyٰ asay shhdaa ky rhaysh gahwn tk phncha day ga، chahay wh apnay bstr pr hy mr jayay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3809","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rbay bnt albraa، jw harsh bnt ky waldh thyn۔ swrqh، nby kay pas aayy awr kha، \khda kay rswl، kya aap mjhay harsh kay baray myn nhyn btayyn gay؟\"" (wh bdr ky lrayy myn ayk bay trtyb tyr say mara gya tha) agr wh jnt myn hay tw myn sbr ka mzahrh krwn ga، lykn agr as ka dwsra anjam hwa tw myn as kay lyay rwnay myn khwd kw zyadh mhnt krwn ga۔\"" as nay jwab dya kh harsh ky man jnt myn baghat hyn awr aap ka byta frdws aalyٰ kw phnch gya hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3810","as nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm awr aap kay sathy nklay awr mshrkyn say phlay bdr phnchay awr jb mshrk phnchay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh athw as bagh myn jao js ky wsat zmyn w aasman kay brabr hay۔ amyr by۔ as pr alhmam nay kha، \braww، braww!\"" awr jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say pwchha kh aap kw yh khnay pr ks chyz nay mjbwr kya hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kchh nhyn، myn khda ky qsm khata hwn، khda kay rswl، mgr yh amyd hay kh myn as kay bashndwn myn shaml hw jaon“۔ as nay asay btaya kh wh an myn say hwga۔ phr as nay apnay trksh myn say kchh khjwryn nkalyn awr anhyn khanay lga lykn thwry dyr bad khnay lga kh agr myn as wqt tk zndh rha jb tk khjwr nh khaon tw as ka mtlb lmby amr hwgy۔ chnanchh as nay apnay pas mwjwd khjwryn phynk dyn awr phr dshmn say lrtay rhay yhan tk kh wh mara gya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3811","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm apnay myn say ks kw shhyd smjhtay hw؟ as kay snnay walwn nay jwab dya kh rah khda myn mara janay wala shhyd rswl khda hay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: myry amt myn shhyd hwnay walay bht km hwn gay، jw allh ky rah myn mara jayay wh shhyd hay، jw allh ky rah myn mray wh shhyd hay، jw taawn say mray wh shhyd hay awr jw pyt ky bymary myn mray wh shhyd hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3812","abdallh by۔ amrw rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kwyy jngy jmaat ya lshkr lrayy kay lyay nhyn nklay ga، mal ghnymt hasl kray ga awr dw thayy anaamat hasl kyay bghyr slamty say waps nhyn jayay ga، awr kwyy jng psnd jmaat ya lshkr apny amydwn say mayws nhyn hw ga awr pwra pwra anaam hasl kyay bghyr shkst kha jayay ga۔ * tjwyz yh hay kh dw thayy mhfwz wapsy awr mal ghnymt hay jw anhyn as dnya myn mlay ga، baqy tysra aakhrt myn ajr hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3813","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs bghyr lray، ya asay apna frz smjhay bghyr mray tw wh ayk qsm kay nfaq kay mrtkb hw ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3814","hzrt abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr kha: ayk aadmy mal ghnymt kay lyay lrta hay، ayk lrayy ky shhrt kay lyay awr dwsra as ky [bhadry] ka drjh dykhnay kay lyay، an myn say kwn rah khda myn hay؟ as nay jwab dya، \jw lrta hay kh khda ka klam ghalb hw، wh khda ky rah myn hay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3815","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ghzwh tbwk say waps aayay awr mdynh kay qryb phnchay tw aap nay frmaya: ”mdynh myn aysay lwg mwjwd hyn jnhwn nay aap kay sath rhnay myn kwtahy nhyn ky jhan bhy aap gyay awr jhan bhy aap gzray۔ ayk wrzhn hay، \jw aap kay anaam kw bantnay myn nakam nhyn hwyay hyn۔\"" an kay as tajb kay azhar pr kh jb wh mdynh myn hy thay tw yh sch hwna chahyay، aap nay frmaya: ’’jb kh wh abhy mdynh myn hyn، ayk maqwl azr kay zryaay waps rkha ja rha hay۔‘‘ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3816","mslm nay asay jabr ky snd say nql kya hay۔"
"3817","abdallh by۔ amrw nay byan kya kh ayk aadmy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr aap say jhad myn hsh lynay ky ajazt tlb ky۔ as nay as say pwchha kh kya as kay waldyn abhy tk zndh hyn، awr jb as nay jwab dya kh wh zndh hyn، tw as nay as say kha kh wh an ky trf say kwshsh kray۔ * nkth angryzy myn atna wazh nhyn jtna arby myn hay۔ jhad، jbkh kafrwn kay khlaf lrnay ka lfz hay، as ka mtlb bhy aam twr pr kwshsh krna ya kwshsh krna hay۔ as shkhs nay jhad myn hsh lynay ky khwahsh zahr ky، awr jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw malwm hwa kh as kay waldyn abhy zndh hyn tw aap nay frmaya: ffymَ fy jhdٌ (bkhary w mslm)۔"
"3818","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh fth mkh kay dn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”fth kay bad kwyy hjrt nhyn hay، blkh srf jhad awr nyk nyt hay، lhza jb tmhyn jng kay lyay blaya jayay tw nkl jao۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3819","amran bn hsyn rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry amt ka ayk tbqh hq kay lyay lrta rhay ga awr apnay mkhalfyn pr ghalb aayay ga yhan tk kh an ka aakhry hsh djal say lray ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3820","abw amamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy jngy mhm myn shaml nhyn hwa، nh ksy jngjw kw lys krta hay، awr nh hy ksy jngjw kay ghr walwn ky dykh bhal krta hay tw wh qyamt kay dn say phlay as pr naghany aaft nazl kray ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3821","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apnay mal، apny jan awr apny zbanwn kw mshrkwn say jhad myn astamal krw۔ asay abwdaod، nsayy awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3822","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tm sb kw slam krw gay، khana khlao gay awr dshmnwn kay srwn pr war krw gay tw tm jnt kay wars hw jao gay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3823","fdala by۔ abyd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw mr jayay ga as kay aamal pwray hw jayyn gay، swayay as kay jw allh ky rah myn mhaz pr hw، kywnkh as kay aamal qyamt tk brhtay jayyn gay awr wh qbr ky aazmaysh say mhfwz rhay ga۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3824","darmy nay asay aqbh bn ky snd say nql kya hay۔ ’’aamr۔"
"3825","maaz b۔ jbl rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay as snnay kay baray myn btaya kh jw shkhs awntny kay dw dwdhnay kay drmyan ka wqt allh ky rah myn lrta rhay ga as kay lyay jnt yqyny hay، agr kwyy allh ky rah myn zkhmy hwa ya kwyy msybt phnchy tw wh qyamt kay dn aayay ga jhan tk mmkn hw skay ga، as ka rng zafran awr as ka rng zafran awr as kay arq say hw ga۔ rastay myn، as pr shhdaa ky mhr hwgy۔\ * as say mrad khas twr pr awntny kw dwdh planay ky aadt hay، phr asay thwra sa chhwr kr as kay bchay kw dwdh playa jata hay، as kay bad asay dwbarh dwdh playa jata hay۔ lhza dw dwdh kay drmyan ky mdt bht km wqt ky nshandhy krty hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3826","khrym by۔ fatk nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh jw shkhs allh ky rah myn hsh dalay ga tw as kay lyay sat sw gna zyadh lkha jayay ga۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3827","abw amamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sb say afzl sdqat allh kay rastay myn ayk bray khymay ka sayh krna، allh ky rah myn bnday ka thfh dyna، ya allh ky rah myn atny bry awntny mhya krna hay jw ghwray say dhanp skay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3828","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs allh kay khwf say rwta hay wh jhnm myn nhyn jayay ga yhan tk kh dwdh thn myn waps aajayay awr allh ka kwyy bndh rahِ khda myn mty awr jhnm ka dhwan dwnwn nhyn kha skay ga۔ trmzy nay asay nql kya hay، awr nsayy nay ayk awr nskhh myn yh azafh kya hay، \kbhy mslman kay nthnwn myn۔\"" as kay zryah ayk awr myn anhwn nay mzyd kha، \""khda kay bnday kay pyt myn kbhy bhy؛ awr khda kay bnday kay dl myn bkhl awr ayman kbhy jma nhyn hwn gay۔\"""""""
"3829","sydna abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dw aankhyn aysy hyn jnhyn jhnm kbhy nhyn chhwyay gy، ayk wh aankh jw allh kay khwf say rwty hay awr dwsry wh aankh jw allh ky rah myn rat gzarty hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3830","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sathy myn say ayk phary rastay pr aaya js myn mythay pany ka ayk chhwta chshmh tha awr asay dykh kr khwsh hwa tw as nay lwgwn say alg hw kr as rastay pr rhnay ky khwahsh zahr ky۔ as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say as ka zkr kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aysa mt krw، kywnkh jb tm myn say kwyy allh ky rah myn rhay tw yh str sal ky as kay ghr myn nmaz say zyadh afzl hay، kya tm nhyn chahtay kh allh tmhyn bkhsh day awr tmhyn jnt myn dakhl kr day، allh ky rah myn lrw، jw allh ky rah myn lrta rhay ga as wqt tk wh dwdh pynay waly dw awntny kay drmyan brabr hw jayay ga۔ *yh fal jma myn hyn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3831","hzrt asman rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh ky rah myn srhd pr ayk dn hr jgh kay hzar dnwn say bhtr hay۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3832","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mjhay jnt myn dakhl hwnay walay phlay tyn aadmy dkhayay gyay: ayk shhyd، ayk braazm jw hram chyzwn say prhyz krta hay، awr ayk ghlam jw allh ky achhy abadt krta hay awr apnay srprstwn ky khdmt krta hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3833","abdallh by۔ hbshy rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha gya kh kwn sa aml afzl hay tw aap nay frmaya: ”nmaz myn dyr tk khra hwna“۔ aap say pwchha gya kh kwn sa sdqh sb say afzl hay tw aap nay frmaya: km rkhnay walay ky kwshsh۔ as say pwchha gya kh kwn sa hjrh sb say afzl hay tw jwab dya: wh jw khda ky hram krdh chyzwn kw trk kray۔ aap say pwchha gya kh kwn sa jhad afzl hay tw aap nay frmaya: wh jw mshrkwn kay khlaf apnay mal awr jan say jhad kray۔ aap say pwchha gya kh kwn sa qtl sb say zyadh qabl ahtram hay tw aap nay jwab dya kh js ka khwn bhaya jayay awr js ky swary zkhmy hw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay nsayy ky rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha gya kh kwn sa aml sb say afzl hay tw aap nay frmaya: wh ayman js myn kwyy shk nh hw، wh jhad js myn ghnymt myn khyant nh hw awr wh hj jw qbwl hw۔ aap say pwchha gya kh kwn sy daa sb say afzl hay tw aap nay jwab dya kh ’’abadt myn dyr tk khray rhna‘‘۔ dwnwn nskhay bqyh kay baray myn mtfq hyn۔"
"3834","almqdm b۔ madykryb rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”shhyd kw allh taalyٰ ky trf say 61 nykyan mlty hyn: as kay khwn kay phlay bhanay pr asay bkhsh dya jata hay، asay jnt myn as ka thkanh dkhaya jata hay، asay qbr kay azab say mhfwz rkha jata hay، as kw sb say bry dhsht say mhfwz rkha jata hay، as nay apnay sr pr wh taj rkha hay js myn as ky azt ka taj hay awr as ky shady dnya say bhtr hay۔ bry syah aankhwn waly knwarywn ky 72 bywyan، 3 awr apnay str rshth darwn kay lyay sfarshy bny hyn۔\ 1. as rwayt myn sat chyzyn mzkwr malwm hwty hyn۔ 2. Cf. alqraan؛ 21:103۔ 3. Cf. alqraan، 56:22۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3835","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs allh taalyٰ say bghyr jhad kay mlay tw wh allh taalyٰ say as myn ayb kay sath mlay ga۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3836","as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka arshad nql kya hay kh shhyd kw qtl hwnay myn as say zyadh tklyf nhyn hwty jtny tm myn say ksy kw dnk marnay say hwty hay۔ asay trmzy، nsayy awr darmy nay nql kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3837","abwamamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh kw dw qtrwn awr dw nshanwn say zyadh kwyy chyz mhbwb nhyn، khwfِ khda say aansw ka ayk qtrh awr allh ky rah myn bhayay janay walay khwn ka ayk qtrh، dwnwn nshanat kay baray myn yh hay kh wh allh ky rah myn mlnay wala nshan hay awr ayk nshan jw allh kay ahkam myn say ksy ayk hkm pr aml krnay ky wjh say hwta hay، yh hath paon myn srd ya srd chyzwn say mrad hay۔ mwsm، ya grm zmyn pr sjdh krnay say pyshany pr nshan lgna، ya hj krtay wqt paon pr mty lgna۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3838","abdallh by۔ amrw rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”smndr myn kshty nh chlw swayay hj ya amrh kay wqt ya allh ky rah myn jhad kay wqt، kywnkh smndr kay nychay aag hay awr aag kay nychay smndr hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3839","am hram rzy allh anha say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs twfany smndr myn bymar hw jayay asay ayk shhyd ka swab mlay ga awr jw dwb jayay asay dw shhydwn ka swab mlay ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3840","abw malk ashary rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”jw allh ky rah myn nklay awr mr jayay، ya as ky grdn as kay ghwray ya awnt kay maray janay say twt jayay، ya ksy zhrylay janwr kay dsay ya bstr pr ksy aysy mwt say mr jayay js say allh taalyٰ chahay wh shhyd hay awr jnt myn jayay ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3841","abdallh by۔ amrw nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \ghr lwtna ayk mhm pr janay kay mtradf hay۔\"" * * as kw anaamat say tabyr kya jata hay۔ ayk mhm kay bad wapsy ka mtlb yh hay kh ayk dwsray kw shrwa krnay say phlay aaram awr tazgy ka mwqa dya jata hay، as lyay as kw sfr krnay kay lyay asy trh ka ajr mlta hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3842","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: lrnay walay kw as ka ajr mlta hay awr jw asay lys krta hay asay as ka awr jngjw ka ajr mlta hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3843","abw aywb nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh daralhkwmt tmharay hath say fth hw jayyn gay awr tmhyn bry fwjyn jma krny hwn gy، ayk aadmy ksy jmaat myn shaml hwnay kw tyar nhyn hwga، as lyay wh apny qwm say bhag kr qbylwn kay chkr lgata hay awr apnay aap kw an kay hwalay krta hay، ksy aysay shkhs ky tlash myn hwta hay js ky jgh wh flan flan mhm myn lay۔ * yh wh shkhs hay jw jngy mhm pr bhyjay janay kw napsnd krta hay، lykn agr as kay bdlay myn ksy awr ky jgh lynay kay lyay balkl tyar hw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3844","yala۔ b amyh nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk mhm jwyy ka aalan kya، awr chwnkh myn bht bwrha aadmy tha js ka kwyy nwkr nhyn tha، myn nay as kay bdlay kwyy mlazm dhwnda jw myry khdmt kray۔ mjhay ayk aadmy mla js kw myn nay tyn dynar pysh kyay، jb kchh mal ghnymt phncha tw myn nay asay as ka hsh dyna chaha، chnanchh myn nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gya awr aap say yh maamlh byan kya، lykn aap nay frmaya: myn as kay lyay as dnya awr as kay bad kay tyn dynar kay baray myn srf atna hy tlash kr skta hwn jw asay pysh kyay gyay thay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3845","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh ayk aadmy nay kha: allh kay rswl، ayk aadmy allh ky rah myn jhad myn hsh lyna chahta hay awr kchh dnyawy faydh hasl krna chahta hay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as kay lyay kwyy ajr nhyn hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3846","maaz rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: lrayy dw trh ky hwty hay، jw allh ky rza chahta hay، qayd ky ataat krta hay، as ky qdr krta hay، as kay sathy ky mdd krta hay awr shrart say bchta hay، as kay lyay as wqt tk swab hay jw wh swtay awr jagtay hwyay، lykn jw shkhs tkbr kay sath lrta hay، as kay lyay، jw apnay qayd kw hasl krnay kay lyay awr as ky rza kay lyay lrta hay۔ zmyn myn fsad bghyr ksy alzam kay waps nhyn aata۔‘‘* yany as nay jw ghlt kya hay asay malk، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3847","abdallh by amrw nay byan kya kh as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say jhad kay baray myn btanay kay lyay kha tw aap nay frmaya: agr tm sbr kay sath lrw gay، abdallh bn amrw، allh say apnay ajr ky tlash myn، allh tmhyn dwbarh zndh kray ga awr as say tmhara ajr mangay ga، lykn agr tm bht kchh hasl krnay ky kwshsh myn fzwl dkhaway kay lyay lrw gay tw allh tmhyn bht kchh dkhayay ga awr allh tmhyn dwbarh zndh kray ga۔ tm lrw ya maray jao، abdallh bn amrw، as halt myn allh tmhyn zndh kray ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3848","aqbh by۔ malk rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb myn ayk aadmy kw bhyjta hwn awr wh myra hkm pwra nhyn krta tw kya tm as ky jgh ksy kw mqrr nhyn kr sktay jw myra hkm pwra kray؟ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3849","abw amamh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath ayk mhm myn nklay، jb ayk aadmy ayk ghar pr aaya js myn kchh pany awr sbzyan thyn، tw as nay as myn rhnay awr dnya say knarh kshy akhtyar krnay ky khwahsh zahr ky، tw as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say as baray myn ajazt chahy، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mjhay yhwdyt ya aysayyt nhyn dy gyy thy، blkh as kay hath say sbh swyray hnyf mhmd sly allh alyh wslm ka dyn hwa tha۔ khda ka rasth dnya awr as myn mwjwd tmam chyzwn say bhtr hay awr tm myn say ksy ka mydan jng myn rhna as ky sath sal ky nmaz say bhtr hay۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3850","abadh by۔ asmyt nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \jw allh ky rah myn bghyr araday kay lrta hay lykn rsy kw bandhnay kay lyay lrta hay، asay why mlay ga jw as nay aradh kya tha۔ agr kwyy chahta hay kh wh kchh mady faydh hasl kray jw asay mlay ga، kywnkh wh ksy abdy anaam ka msthq nhyn hwga۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3851","abw sayd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs allh kay rb hwnay، aslam kay dyn hwnay awr mhmd sly allh alyh wslm kay rswl hwnay pr razy hw jayay tw as kay lyay jnt yqyny hay۔ abw sayd as pr khwsh hwyay awr an say kha kh asay dhrayyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay aysa hy kya awr phr frmaya kh ayk awr chyz bhy hay js kay lyay allh taalyٰ bnday kw jnt myn sw drjay blnd kray ga jn myn say hr dw kay drmyan zmyn w aasman kay brabr faslh hay۔ as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh yh kya hay tw aap nay jwab dya: \allh ky rah myn jhad، allh kay rastay myn jhad، allh kay rastay myn jhad۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3852","abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: jnt kay drwazay tlwarwn kay sayay myn hyn۔ ayk aadmy js ky shkl wswrt thy، atha awr abw mwsyٰ say pwchha kh kya myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay؟ awr jb asay jwab mla tw wh apnay sathywn kay pas waps aaya awr kha kh myn tmhyn slam pysh krta hwn، phr apny tlwar ka khnjr twr kr phynk dya، phr apny tlwar lay kr dshmn ky trf chla gya awr asay chlaya yhan tk kh wh mara gya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3853","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay shabh say frmaya: ”jb tmharay bhayy ahd ky lrayy myn maray gyay tw allh nay an ky rwhyn sbz prndwn ky khyty myn dal dyn jw jnt ky ndywn myn atrtay hyn، as kay phl khatay hyn awr arsh kay sayay myn swnay kay chraghwn myn bsyra krtay hyn، phr jb wh an kay khanay pynay kay baray myn pwchhtay hyn tw an kay aaram kay baray myn btatay hyn kh an kay khanay awr pynay ka hal kwn hay؟ kh wh jnt myn zndh thay takh wh jnt ky khwahsh say baz nh aayyn awr allh taalyٰ nay frmaya kh wh an kay baray myn btayay ga، as lyay nazl kya kh jw lwg allh ky rah myn maray gyay hyn anhyn mrdh nh smjhw، blkh wh apnay rb kay pas zndh hyn awr anhyn rzq dya ja rha hay۔ asay mntql kya."
"3854","aba sayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dnya myn mwmn tyn tbqwn myn hyn: wh jw allh awr as kay rswl pr ayman latay hyn awr shk nhyn krtay blkh rah khda myn apnay mal w jan say jhad krtay hyn، wh aadmy js pr lwg apnay mal w jan say bhrwsh krtay hyn، phr wh shkhs jw jb lalch ka azhar krta hay tw as kw chhwr dyta hay awr khda kay lyay bra ghzbnak hay۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3855","abdalrhmn by۔ abwaamrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kwyy mslman yh nhyn chahay ga kh allh taalyٰ tmharay pas lwt jayay awr dnya awr jw kchh as myn hay swayay shhyd kay۔ abn abwaamrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myray nzdyk rah khda myn qtl hwna mjhay khanh bdwshwn awr bstywn kay rhnay say zyadh mhbwb hay۔ * py pr 725 nam abdalrhmn bn kay twr pr zahr hwta hay۔ abw amrh alansary۔ abn abdalbr، astyaab، s 395 nay alwlyd bn ka hwalh dytay hwyay، dwnwn kw ayk aadmy qrar dya hay۔ mslm as asr say kh wh abdalrhmn bn thay۔ amrh ya amyrh almzany، lykn hsay ky srkhy myn as ka nam abdalrhmn bn dya hay۔ abwaamrh۔ as ka khna hay kh wh nby kay shaby hwnay kay lyay mshhwr hyn lykn yh drst nhyn hay۔ wh shamy tha۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3856","hsnh bnt maawyh khty hyn kh an kay chcha nay an say kha kh myn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha tha kh jnt myn kwn hyn، tw aap nay jwab dya kh anbyaa jnt myn hyn، shhdaa jnt myn hyn، shyr khwar bchay jnt myn hyn awr zndh dfn hwnay walay bchay jnt myn hyn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3857","aly، abw drdaa، abwhryrh، abw amamh، abdallh bn. amr، abdallh bn amrw، jabr bn۔ abdallh awr amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw allh ky rah myn chndh bhyjay awr apnay ghr myn thhray as kay lyay hr drhm kay bdlay sat sw drhm hwn gay، lykn jw shkhs lray awr as ky as mhm myn hsh dalay as kay lyay hr drhm kay bdlay sat lakh drhm hwn gay۔ phr aap nay yh aayt tlawt frmayy ’’awr khda js kw chahta hay brhata hay‘‘۔ (alqraan؛ 2:261) asay abn majh nay nql kya hay۔"
"3858","fdala by۔ abyd nay amr bn khtab kay baray myn btaya۔ alkhtab rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: shhdaa char qsm kay hwtay hyn: () wh mwmn js ka ayman achha hw jw dshmn say mqablh kray awr qtl hwnay tk allh kay lyay mkhls hw، awr yh wh hay js ky trf lwg qyamt kay dn as trh ngahyn athayyn gay (as ka sr athayay ga yhan tk kh as ky twpy gr jayay، lykn myn nhyn janta kh wh twpy hay ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm)۔ mwmn aadmy js ka ayman achha hay، jw dshmn say mlta hay awr aysa lgta hay jysay bbwl kay kantwn say as ky khal phar dy gyy hw، awr phr wh dwsray tbqay myn shaml hw، (3) wh mwmn aadmy jw ksy achhay kam kw dwsray kay sath mlata hw jw dshmn say mlta hw awr khda say mkhls hw، jb tk kh wh tysray tbqay myn mara jayay۔ dshmn say mlta hay awr allh kay lyay mkhls rhta hay yhan tk kh wh mara jayay، jw kh chwthay drjay myn hay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3859","atbh by۔ abd alslmy rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mqtwl tyn qsm kay hwtay hyn: (1) wh mwmn jw apnay mal awr jan say rah khda myn jhad krta hay awr jb dshmn say mqablh krta hay tw wh mara jata hay، (as kay baray myn nby sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh wh shhyd jw aazmaysh myn mbtla hw wh allh kay khymay myn hay، as kay arsh kay nychay hay awr nby kay drjay kay alawh nhyn hay۔ (2) wh mwmn jw ayk nyky kw dwsray brayy kay sath mlata hay، jw khda ky rah myn apny jan w mal kay sath lrta hay، jb tk kh wh dshmn say ml kr mara jata hay، (as kay baray myn nby sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh yh ayk pakyzh kar hay js nay as kay gnahwn awr khtaon kw mta dya hay، kywnkh tlwar as kay gnahwn kw mta dyty hay) (3) wh mnafq jw apnay jan w mal say jhad krta hay awr jb dshmn say mqablh krta hay tw wh mara jata hay lykn wh jhnm myn jayay ga kywnkh tlwar nfaq kw mta nhyn skty۔ darymy nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3860","abn ayd rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk aadmy kay jnazay kay lyay tshryf lay gyay، awr jb aap sly allh alyh wslm kw amr rzy allh anh pr lta dya gya۔ alkhtab rzy allh anh nay kha: allh kay rswl sly allh alyh wslm as pr nmaz nh prhw، kywnkh wh ayk fasq aadmy tha، phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay lwgwn ky trf mtwjh hw kr pwchha kh kya an myn say ksy nay aap kw ksy aysay kam myn mshghwl dykha hay js say aap kay mslman hwnay ka pth chlta hw، tw ayk aadmy nay jwab dya kh han، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk rat allh kay rastay myn phrh dya، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: shabh ka khyal hay kh aap jhnm myn janay walwn myn say hyn lykn myn gwahy dyta hwn kh aap jnt myn janay walwn myn say hyn۔ as kay bad aap nay frmaya kh amr rzy allh anh tm say lwgwn kay aamal kay baray myn swal nhyn kya jayay ga blkh tm say schay dyn kay baray myn swal kya jayay ga۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"3861","aqbh by۔ aamr nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw mnbr pr yh frmatay hwyay sna: \an kay lyay jtny taqt hwskay tyar krw، taqt gwly mar rhy hay، taqt gwly mar rhy hay، taqt gwly mar rhy hay۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3862","as nay btaya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh \bazntyny tmharay hathwn shkst kha jayyn gay awr allh tmhara dfaa kray ga، lykn tm myn say kwyy atna ghafl nh hw kh apnay tyrwn say kam nh lay۔\""* * yany wh tyr andazy myn kwtahy nh kray۔ khyal yh hay kh agrchh khda an ka dfaa krta hay، lykn yh anhyn kwshshwn say baz nhyn rkhta۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3863","as nay btaya kh as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay sna hay kh ’’agr kwyy janta hay kh ks trh gwly chlana awr chhwr dyna hay tw wh hmara nhyn hay‘‘ ya ’’as nay nafrmany ky hay۔‘‘ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3864","slamh by۔ alakw nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm aslm kay kchh lwgwn kay pas gyay jw sq* myn shwtng ka mqablh kr rhay thay awr frmaya: \asmayl kay bytay، gwly marw، kywnkh tmharay aabao ajdad tyr andaz thay، myn flan flan ky hmayt krta hwn\""۔ wh phr rk gyay، awr jb as nay pwchha kh kya maamlh hay، tw anhwn nay jwab dya، \""jb aap by ky hmayt kr rhay hyn tw hm kysay gwly mar sktay hyn؟\"" as nay kha، gwly marw، myn tm sb ka sath dyta hwn۔ * mkhtlf wzahtyn dy jaty hyn۔ yh markyt plys (suq) myn hwskta hay۔ mrqat، iv، 202 myn sq kw saq ky jma smjhna awr as ka mtlb yh hay kh wh apnay pyrwn pr thay، awnt pr swar nhyn thay۔ yhan tk kha gya hay kh prhna swq hay awr yh ayk jgh ka nam hay۔ lykn mjhay aysy ksy jgh ka kwyy hwalh nhyn mla۔ yh sb kchh as bat kw zahr krta hay kh jb wh apnay tkhyl kw dhyla chhwr dytay hyn tw mtrjm ks qdr mshkl rastay kw zahr kr sktay hyn۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3865","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh abwtlhh awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk hy dhal astamal kr rhay thay۔ abw tlhh ayk achhay tyr andaz thay awr jb anhwn nay gwly chlayy tw nby sly allh alyh wslm nay apny trf dykha awr dykha kh tyr khan gyay؟ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3866","as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh frmaya: ” brkt ghwrwn ky pyshany pr hwty hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3867","jryr by۔ abdallh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw ghwray ky pyshany myn angly ghmatay hwyay dykha awr frma rhay thay kh ghwrwn ky pyshany myn qyamt tk kay lyay nyky hay yany swab awr ghnymt۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3868","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs allh pr ayman awr as kay waday pr yqyn kay sath allh ky rah myn ghwray kw rwkay ga tw qyamt kay dn as ka khana، pyna، gwbr awr pyshab as kay plray myn hw ga۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
