"3870","abdallh by۔ hzrt amr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an ghwrwn kay drmyan dwr lgayy jnhyn trbyt say dbla kr dya gya tha alhafyh say lay kr snyh alwdaa tk chh myl ka faslh tha awr aap nay an ghwrwn kay drmyan dwr lgayy jnhwn nay thanyh say msjd bn zryq tk ayk myl ka faslh rkha tha۔ * thanyh ayk phary drh hay۔ snyat alwdaa mdynh ka nzarh krnay wala ayk rasth hay js say lwg mkh kay rastay pr jatay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3871","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ayk awntny thy js ka nam aladbh tha jsay ksy awr nay pychhay nhyn chhwra tha، lykn ayk khanh bdwsh arb aap kay ayk nwjwan awnt pr swar hwa awr wh as say aagay nkl gyy۔ as say mslmanwn kw tklyf hwyy، lykn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \yh allh ka hq hay kh dnya myn kwyy chyz as kay pst kyay bghyr blnd nh hw۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3872","aqbh by۔ aamr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh allh taalyٰ ayk tyr kay bdlay tyn aadmywn kw jnt myn dakhl kray ga: bnanay wala jb as kay bnanay myn achha aradh hw، asay marnay wala awr hath lganay wala، tw gwly marw awr swary krw، lykn tmhary swary mjhay tmhary swary say zyadh psnd hay، hr wh chyz js say aadmy khylta hay، as kay ghwray kw khylna، as ky trbyt awr as ky trbyt kay alawh۔ apny bywy kay sath، kywnkh an ka talq shyh say hay۔\ trmzy awr abn majh nay asay nql kya hay، awr abwdaod awr darmy nay mzyd kha: \""agr kwyy shkhs tyr andazy kw trk kr day awr as myn mahr hwnay kay bad as kay lyay napsndydh hw، tw yh ayk namt hay jw as nay trk kr dy\"" ya as nay kha \""js ky as nay nashkry ky hay۔\"""""""
"3873","abw njyh alslmy rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”js nay allh ky rah myn tyr mara as kay lyay jnt myn ayk drjh hay، agr kwyy allh kay rastay myn tyr chlata hay tw yh as kay lyay ksy kw aazad krnay kay brabr hay، awr jw shkhs aslam ky trf say ayk bal sfyd kray ga، wh qyamt kay dn as kay lyay qyamt ka dn hay۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔ abwdaod nay phla hsh، nsayy nay phla awr dwsra awr trmzy nay dwsra awr tysra hsh nql kya hay۔ nsayy awr trmzy ka nskhh hay، \agr kwyy khda ky rah myn sfyd bal pyda kray\"" kay bjayay \""aslam ky trf say\""۔"""""
"3874","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mjaz srf tyr chlanay، awntwn ya ghwrwn ky dwr myn hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3875","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy dw dwsray kay sath ghwray myn dakhl hw tw as myn kwyy bhlayy nhyn agr asay yqyn hw kh asay mara nhyn ja skta، lykn agr wh nh hw tw kwyy hrj nhyn۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔ abwdaod ky rwayt myn hay kh \agr kwyy ghwray kw dw awrwn kay sath dakhl kray jb asay yqyn nh hw kh asay mara nhyn ja skta، tw yh jwa nhyn hay، lykn jb kwyy ghwray kw dw awrwn kay sath dakhl kray jb asay yqyn hw kh asay mara nhyn ja skta، yh jwa hay۔\"""""""
"3876","'amran by۔ hsyn rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka frman nql kya hay، ’’ksy dwsray ghwray kw ksy ky trf lay kr chlaya nhyn jana chahyay۔ * ksy kay ghwray pr swar hwnay kay lyay shwr mchana nhyn chahyay، awr ksy kw apnay sath ghwray kw nhyn lay jana chahyay js pr wh mntql hw jayay agr asay dr hw kh as ka ghwra mara jayay ga۔ abwdaod awr nsayy nay asay nql kya hay awr trmzy nay asay zbrdsty zbt krnay kay hsay myn azafh kay sath nql kya hay۔"
"3877","abw qtadh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sb say bhtr ghwra wh hay js kay chhray pr shalh hay awr as kay awpry hwnt pr sfyd dhbh hay* as kay bad ghwra aata hay js kay chhray pr shalh hwta hay awr tangyn sfyd hwty hyn، swayay dayyn hsay kay، agr wh syah nh hw tw an nshanat kay sath syah khlyj wala ghwra۔ *arthm۔ as ka mtlb ya tw yh hw skta hay kh as kay awpry hwnt pr sfyd dhbh hay، ya as ky nak kay mqam pr۔ asay trmzy awr darmy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3878","abw whb aljshmy rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr syah ghwray kay pas rkhw js ky tangwn pr sfyd awr sfyd hw، ya sfyd dhnk kay sath awr pyrwn pr sfyd، ya sfyd blghm kay sath syah awr pyrwn myn sfyd hw۔ asay aba daod awr nsayy nay nql kya hay۔"
