"3880","atbh by۔ abd alslmy rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”ghwrwn ky pyshanyan، ayal ya dm nh katw، kywnkh an ky dmyn mkhywn kw bhganay ka zryah hyn، an ky ayalyn anhyn grmy dyty hyn، awr an ky pyshanywn myn brkt hwty hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3881","abw whb aljshmy rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ghwrwn kw bandhw، an ky pyshanywn kay balwn awr chwtrwn kw rgrw (ya aap nay frmaya، an kay kwlhwn) awr an kay glay myn chyzyn dalyn، lykn kman kay tar nh lgayyn۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3882","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk aysay bnday thay jw hm pr srf tyn batwn ka atlaq krtay thay jn ka atlaq aam lwgwn pr nhyn krtay thay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn mkml wzw krnay، sdqh nh khanay awr gdhay kw ghwry ka ahath nh krnay ka hkm dya۔ * as say mrad rswl allh kay khandan kay afrad hyn۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3883","aly rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw ayk khchr pysh kya gya js pr aap swar hwyay، tw aly rzy allh anh nay frmaya: ”agr hm gdhay kw ghwry bna dyn gay tw hmaray pas as qsm kay janwr hwn gay“، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”srf why lwg krtay hyn jw nhyn jantay۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
