"3891","aly rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay hath myn ayk arby kman thy awr ayk shkhs kay hath myn farsy kman dykh kr aap nay frmaya: yh kya hay، asay phynk dw، as kay pas rkhw awr as trh kay nyzwn kay pas rkhw، kywnkh allh an kay sath dyn ky hmayt krnay awr zmyn pr tmhyn qaym krnay myn mdd kray ga۔ * yh fal jma myn hay، js say zahr hwta hay kh jb aadmy kw kha jata hay kh wh kman phynk day jsay wh atha rha hay، lwgwn kw ayk aam hkm dya jata hay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
