"3896","abw bshyr alansary rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh jb wh ayk sfr myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath thay tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk kw yh khnay kay lyay bhyja kh awnt kay glay myn kman ka har ya kwyy awr chyz nh chhwry jayay blkh asay kat dya jayay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3897","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm zrkhyz mlk myn sfr krw tw awntwn kw an ka hq zmyn say dw، awr jb khshky kay wqt sfr krw tw anhyn jldy say nklw، jb rat kw prao krw tw rastwn say dwr rhw، kywnkh yh wh jgh hyn jhan say drnday gzrtay hyn awr rat kw kyray mkwrwn ka thkanh hyn۔ ayk wrzhn myn hay، \jb aap khshk saly kay wqt sfr krtay hyn tw an kay sath jldy krw jb tk kh an ka myrw hw۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3898","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath sfr myn thay kh ayk aadmy swary pr aaya awr dayyn bayyn mrnay lga، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js kay pas zyadh swary hw wh asay qrz day js kay pas kwyy nh hw awr js kay pas zyadh rzq hw wh asay day js kay pas kwyy nhyn hay۔ as nay kha kh as nay trh trh ky jayydadwn ka tzkrh kya yhan tk kh wh yh swchnay lgay kh an myn say ksy kw bhy ksy azafy chyz ka hq nhyn hay۔ * awnt bzahr thka hwa tha، awr lgta hay kh aadmy adhr adhr dykh rha hay kh aaya asay kwyy mdd ml skty hay۔ ayk awr tjwyz yh hay kh wh shkhs apna saman awnt pr lad kr chl rha tha، lykn alfaz as ky tayyd nhyn krtay۔ sy ayf mrqat، chharm، 213 ch۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
